\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gallus de Aula Regia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Malogranatum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Lib. 1. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Liber primus malogranati.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Iste primus liber qui est de statu incipiencium habet prohemium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Erl\u228 \'e4uterung der nachfolgenden Tabula (in Rot): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ad habendum noticiam presentis tabule que docet prompte}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quamlibet materiam huius primi libri malogranati invenire ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) alphabetische Tabula: [dist.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , [cap.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , [littera] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 X\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abbas sive prelatus suam semper debet aspicere fragilitatem ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 X: Vocacionis modis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est triplex. Ibidem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit prologus in malogranatum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Fili accedens ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Sir 2,1]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Sancta trinitas pater et filius et spiritus sanctus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text (Dist. 1, cap. 1): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit nobilissimi libri malogranati capitulum primum. Filius patri loquitur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Verba exhortacionis ex tuo ore, o pater}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... status incipiencium seu penitencium aliqualiter ista legentibus patefiat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit liber primus malogranati qui tractat de statu incipiencium.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Scripsit autem istum librum frater Gerardus Sessynck de Embrica presbiter conventualis Marie pacis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Hain 7449\endash 7451. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 2131; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 15153; Cardelle de Hartmann S. 559\endash 564. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 2, Sp. 1063\endash 1065; ebd. Bd. 11, Sp. 486; M. Gerwing, Malogranatum oder der dreifache Weg zur Vollkommenheit. Ein Beitrag zur Spiritualit\u228 \'e4t des Sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalters, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1986 (Ver\u246 \'f6ffentlichungen des Collegium Carolinum, 57), bes. S. 122\endash 136 zur hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung. \endash  129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

