\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\endash b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Alphabetische \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Tabula \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 zu den Texten 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , bezogen auf die Foliierung \u8222 \'84Ia\ldblquote  etc. (s.o.; Hand C). (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Erl\u228 \'e4uterung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad inveniendum distinctiones ad predicandum utiles vel ad corrigendos mores nota quod folia sequentis libri signata sunt per sex alfabeta ... Notandum etiam quod circa medium libri defectus est XVIII foliorum que habentur in postilla Hugonis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hugo de Sancto Caro}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 super librum sapientie in fine \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [vgl. 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Qui liber iacet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et quod in eo magis est notabile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per rusas litteras absque numeris positas invenitur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit de a littera.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [recte: Abiit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dilectus quinque modis V\u176 \'b0 e ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Visiones dei VI\u176 \'b0 y \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [in Rot:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 o.\~\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Es folgt Vermerk von Schreiberhand (in Rot): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quod hic deficit quere in fine libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\endash b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Fortsetzung, endend: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Yris beate virgini comparatur V\u176 \'b0 m.}

