\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Henricus Millingen}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sermo ad religiosas personas}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\scaps\lang1033\fs26 S\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ermo ad religiosas personas.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Non vos me elegistis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... Verba scribuntur Johannis XV \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [16], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 transsumptive autem sumuntur pro exordio nostri presentis sermonis. Ex quibus verbis thematis intelligimus varios fructus etutilitates quas homo potest consequi ... \endash  ... ubicumque volunt. Igitur simus deo grati et rogemus ipsum ut donet nobis graciam perseverandi in religiosa vita ut post hanc vitam consequi valeamus eternam felicitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quam nobis omnibus faveat pater ... Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

