\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Nider}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Consolatorium timoratae conscientiae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Redactio brevior)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tractatus eximii doctoris Iohannis Nyder contra timoratamconscienciam. Capitulum primum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de septem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fructibus bone consciencie.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Apud disciplinas reperimus phisicas diversis morbis corporum medicos tradidisse antydota diversa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... Et tantum pro consolacione timorate consciencie dixisse sufficiat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit tractatus notabilis contra timoratam conscienciam editus a Iohanne Nyder Nuremburgensi ordinis predicatorum sacre theologie eximio professore. Scriptus Mariepacis 1476 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [letzte Ziffer von Schreiberhand von \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 5 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 6 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 korrigiert].< \endash  Kurzfassung in 26 Kapiteln, so u.a. auch K\u246 \'f6ln StA GB 4\u176 \'b0 156, II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 465 mit Suppl. (Hs. genannt); Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 3282 f.; Kaeppeli Nr. 2535 (Hs. genannt). VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 6, Sp. 971\endash 977; Van den Bosch, Observantie, S. 143, Anm. 99. \endash  25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

