\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bartholomaeus Pisanus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summa de casibus conscientiae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Alphabetisches Verzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abbas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abbatissa ... Zelus etc. Deo gracias. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quoniam ut ait Gregorius super Ezechielem nullum omnipotenti deo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abbas. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Abbas in monasterio conferre potest}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... tunc est invidia ut dictum est supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Invidia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u167 \'a7 ii\u176 \'b0. Et sic est finis. Deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit summa de casibus consciencie sub anno domini Millesimo quadringentesimo xxxvii\u176 \'b0 scriptum et completum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per manus Johannis then Koer clericum uxuratum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 feria tercia post dominicam Iudica me etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Nach Absatz:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Consummatum fuit hoc opus in civitate Pysana per fratrem Bartholomeum ordinis predicatorum doctorem decretorum anno domini M\u176 \'b0 tricentesimo xxxviii\u176 \'b0 die mensis Decembris tempore sanctissimi patris et domini domini Benedicti pape duodecim. Predictus autem frater Bartholomeus compositor huius libri obiit anno domini M\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 xlviii\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [recte: 1347] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 secunda die Iulii. Cuius anima requiescat in sancta pace. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \endash  Druck: GW 3450\endash 3456. Schulte GQ Bd. 2, S. 428 f.; Michaud-Quantin S. 60\endash 62; Kaeppeli Nr. 436 (Hs. genannt); Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 5052 mit Suppl.; CALMA Bd. 2,1, S. 65, Nr. 11. \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) leer.}

