\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bartholomaeus Pisanus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summa de casibus conscientiae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Prolog: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prologus super summa Pysana.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quoniam ut ait Gregorius super Ezechielem nullum omnipotenti deo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit summa.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Abbas in suo monast}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [er]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 io conferre potest}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tunc est invidia ut dictum est supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Invidia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u167 \'a7 ii\u176 \'b0. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Consummatum et factum est hoc opus in civitate Pysana per fratrem Bartholomeum de Sancto Concordio ordinis fratrum predicatorum doctorem decretorum anno domini M\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 xxxviii die septima mensis Decembris tempore sanctissimi in Christo patris ac domini domini Benedicti pape xii. Predictus autem frater Bartholomeus compositor huius libri obiit anno domini M\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 xlvii\u176 \'b0 die secunda mensis Iulii. Cuius anima requiescat in eo qui sine fine vivit et regnat in secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < Angeschlossen: (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Abk\u252 \'fcrzungsverzeichnis zum Werk; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) alphabetisches Verzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abbas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abbatissa ... Zelus. Deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: GW 3450\endash 3456. Schulte GQ Bd. 2, S. 428 f.; Michaud-Quantin S. 60\endash 62; Kaeppeli Nr. 436 (Hs. genannt); Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 5052 mit Suppl.; CALMA Bd. 2,1, S. 65, Nr. 11.}

