\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\endash b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Drei {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Theologische Notate}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; von einer sp\u228 \'e4teren Hand des 15. Jh.s) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Effectus corporis dominici.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < Drei Verse Walther I Nr. 1746 mit Interlinearglossen; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Decem plage Egyptiace.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < Sieben Verse Walther I Nr. 14595, 17276 (Walther II Nr. 27492c)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ; (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; von Schreiberhand) De Iudaeis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quatuor ex causis Iudeis parcitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hee sunt lex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 patres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 extrema fides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 memoracio Christi. Prima quia legem veterem habemus ab ipsis ... populi mei etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Ps 58, 12]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

