\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Meditationes circa celebrationem missae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Meditaciones devote et breves circa celebracionem misse.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Missa suo modo tam plena est misteriis sicut mare guttis, sicut sol atomis, sicut firmamentum stellis et sicut celum empireum angelis. Tu ergo, sacerdos, qui missam celebrare desideras ante omnia stude quantum prevales te ab exterioribus abstrahere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Discussio consciencie.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ingemisce et dole quod adhuc ita carnalis sis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oracio ante missam.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O piissime et amantissime domine ego indignus peccator cum consciencia trepida}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quando accedis ad altare.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hiis igitur et aliis secundum tuam possibilitatem rite premissis accede ad sanctum altare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancta facie domini oracio.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Salve sancta facies nostri redemptoris in qua nitet species}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [vgl. RH Nr. 18189]; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Collecta.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Deus qui nobis signatis lumine vultus tui memoriale tuum ad instanciam Veronice ymaginem tuam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... ad faciem videre mereamur. Qui vivit. Innocencius papa quartus dedit omnibus istam oracionem dicentibus septem annos indulgenciarum et septem karenas. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Kontemplativer Wegweiser durch die Messfeier mit Anleitungen und Gebets- bzw. Gesangstexten. Eine Messerkl\u228 \'e4rung mit \u228 \'e4hnlichem Beginn bei Franz, Messe, S. 584.}

