\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aegidius Assisias}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dicta (Verba aurea)}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 cap. 6 (De patientia). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De virtute paciencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 secundum Egidium.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Qui pacienter sustineret tribulaciones propter deum cito veniret ad magnam graciam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... nisi vincat se ipsum. Hec frater Egidius. Et sic est finis huius operis. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Dicta beati Aegidii Assisiensis, Quaracchi 1905 (Bibliotheca Franciscana ascetica medii aevi, 3), S. 18\endash 23. Dasselbe Exzerpt u.a. Mainz StB Hs I 33, 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Zumkeller, Nachtrag zu Nr. 54 (irrt\u252 \'fcmlich Aegidius Romanus zugewiesen); S. Tosti, Descriptio codicum Franciscanorum bibliothecae Riccardianae Florentinae (Continuatio), in: Archivum Franciscanum Historicum 9, 1916, S. 395\endash 442, hier 438; Mohan S. 341*; CALMA Bd. 1, S. 50. \endash  50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

