\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dionysius Cartusianus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De vita et statu canonicorum, sacerdotum et ministrorum ecclesiae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Artikelverzeichnis zum Werk; (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tractatus magistri Dyonisii Carthusiensis de vita sacerdotum. Prohemium.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Maledictus homo ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Ier 48,10]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Deus maiestatis immense in suo obsequio despicit indevotum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  ... puritatis fruicionem feliciter perducantur ad laudem et gloriam omnipotentis qui est super omnia deus sublimis et benedictus. Amen\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\scaps\lang1033\fs26 E\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 xplicit tractatus magistri Dyonisii Carthusiensis in Ruremunda qui tractat de vita sacerdotum ac canonicorum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Druck: Dionysii Cartusiani Opera omnia, Bd. 37, Tournai 1909, S. 163\endash 207. Dionysii Cartusiensis Opera selecta, Bd. 1: K. Emery, Prolegomena: Bibliotheca manuscripta; IA: Studia bibliographica, Turnhout 1991 (= CCCM 121), bes. S. 173; S. 236, Nr. 89 (Hs. genannt).}

