\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Stella clericorum cum commento}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 rolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Circa inicium tractatus stelle clericorum architector philosophie in \lquote De celo et mundo\rquote  proprietates celi describens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quasi stella matutina in medio nebule }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Sir 50,6] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 id est peccatorum. Proprietates huius stelle matutine possunt referri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  ... Et ergo in bonis ambulate in domo domini. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Iste libellus qui intitulatur stella clericorum principali divisione dividitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... deus deorum in Syon id est in celesti patria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod nobis prestare dignetur Ihesus Christus Marie filius qui in secula seculorum sit benedictus. Amen. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ruck des Grundtexts: Hain (Copinger) 15060\endash 15080; Copinger 5632\endash 5659; E. H. Reiter, Stella clericorum. Edited from Wavreumont (Stavelot), Monast\u232 \'e8re St-R\u233 \'e9macle, MS. s.n., Toronto 1997 (Toronto Medieval Latin Texts, 23), S. 17\endash 50 (Text der Hs. insbesondere gegen Schluss abweichend). Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 477 (Prolog und Kommentar), 4435 mit Suppl. (Text). Zum Werk und zur hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung A. Garc\u237 \'eda y Garc\u237 \'eda, Manuscritos de la \u8222 \'84Stella clericorum\ldblquote , in: Scripta theologica 16, 1984, S. 395\endash 404; E. H. Reiter, The Stella clericorum and its Readers: A Study of the Reception of Popular Theology in the Later Middle Ages, Diss. phil. Toronto 1994 (nicht eingesehen). \endash  95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

