\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hrabanus Maurus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De institutione clericorum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hrabanus minimus servorum dei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... Cum te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sancte pater ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis zum Werk (83 Kap.); (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber Hrabani Mauri de institutione clericorum. De una dei ecclesia catholica.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aeclesia {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [!] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 ergo dei catholica}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  ... tota fidei credulitas amittitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Wohl \u228 \'e4ltester erhaltener Textzeuge einer gek\u252 \'fcrzten \u8222 \'84rheinischen\ldblquote  Sonderredaktion, vgl. detailliert Zimpel (1996; s.o.), S. 103\endash 105, 172, 249\endash 252 u.\u246 \'f6. sowie 281\endash 424 (Ed. des Grundtextes). K. Bodarw\u233 \'e9, Sanctimoniales litteratae, s.o., S. 267.}

