\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guilelmus Peraldus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summa de virtutibus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Inhalt: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt capitula in tractatu de virtutibus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Presens opus habet quinque partes principales}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tractatus moralis de virtutibus et prologus in opus sequens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum circa utilia studere debeamus exemplo Salomonis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tractatus de virtute in communi. Primum capitulum: Quod oporteat virtutem commendari.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Si separaveris ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Ier 15,19]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Preciosum est anima, proverbiorum vi }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [26]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Mulier animam viri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  ... parentes nostri ad celestem hereditatem. Amen. Finito libro sit laus et gloria Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Es folgt (342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) spalten\u252 \'fcbergreifend auf dem unteren Rand in Rot: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Liber iste conscriptus est iussu domini Ottonis abbatis Bergensis anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cc\u176 \'b0 lxx\u176 \'b0 vi\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: GW 12051\endash 12057 u.\u246 \'f6. Kaeppeli Nr. 1622 B. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 5601 mit Suppl. (Hs. genannt). VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 10, Sp. 1116\endash 1129, bes. 1117\endash 1119.}

