\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Expositio canonis missae cum meditationibus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Carissimi, ad sacri canonis exposicionem et misticam signorum representacionem intelligendam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic incipit sancte misse exposicio.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Missa a diversis diversimode exponitur, a sublimibus sublimitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic incipit exposicio sacri canonis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Te igitur clementissime pater etc.\~{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hic est notandum quod sacerdos dicens hanc oracionem profunde}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt devotissime meditaciones infra divinissimum sacre misse officium devocius meditande. Sequitur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O venerande dei sacerdos tu qui ad tantum tamquam dignissimum altaris sacrificium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... sed hauriat aquas in gaudio de fontibus salvatoris domini nostri Ihesu Christi in secula seculorum benedicti. Amen. Es sic est finis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \endash  Vorlage der Abschrift Ms. B 129, 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Ferner auch in Ms. B 205, 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Darmstadt LuHB Hs 404, 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Hs 958, Nr. 1; Mainz StB Hs I 156, 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Trier StB Hs. 670/238, 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; teilweise auch K\u246 \'f6ln StA GB 4\u176 \'b0 230, 178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Trier, Priesterseminar, Cod. 149, 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Trier StB Hs. 787/1359, 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

