\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Essendia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Determinatio quorundam dubitabilium circa acta seu dicta per spiritum in Meyerich}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit determinatio quorundam dubitabilium circa acta seu dicta per spiritum in Meyerick quam decidit frater Johannes de Essendia ordinis predicatorum conventus Wezaliensis sacre theologie professor.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rectum est verbum ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Ps 32,4]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Nondum in Christo radicata et fundata mens humana fluctui maris similis est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  ... Eciam in margine aliqua notabo que facient ad aliquorum aperciorem intelligenciam. Et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sit laus et gloria trinis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Colophons Nr. 20858]. \endash  Kommentar zur Wundererz\u228 \'e4hlung 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , weitere Angaben vgl. dort. Kaeppeli Nr. 2303 (Hs. genannt). \endash  129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bis auf den o.g. Besitzvermerk (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) leer.}

