\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Raimundus Lullus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De articulis fidei (Liber apostrophe)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit summa nova magistri Raymundi novi philosophi de articulis fidei.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < Epistola: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Suscipiat sublimis apex reverenda corona ecclesie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic intendimus probare deum esse ... et hoc per quinque raciones.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ad probacionem articulorum fidei accedentes antequam probemus unum deum esse}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... quod arma clericorum sunt armis eorum nobiliora et eciam fortiora. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quando factus sit iste tractatus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Factus fuit iste tractatus Rome anno domini M\u176 \'b0 ccxcvi et completus ibidem in vigilia Iohannis baptiste ... infideles conversi nobiscum secure occurrant eidem domino Ihesu Christo cui est honor et gloria per omnia secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: I. Salzinger (Hg.), Raymundi Lulli Opera omnia, Bd. 4, Mainz 1729, Nr. IX (Repr. Frankfurt/M. 1965, hier S. 505\endash 561); Ed. in CCCM als Opus Lat. Nr. 66 geplant. E. W. Platzeck, Raimund Lull. Sein Leben \endash  seine Werke; die Grundlagen seines Denkens (Prinzipienlehre), Bd. 2, D\u252 \'fcsseldorf 1964 (Bibliotheca Franciscana, 6), S. 29* f., Nr. 78. Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 335 bo. D\u237 \'edaz y D\u237 \'edaz Nr. 1783 f. DSAM Bd. 13, Sp. 171\endash 187. \endash  201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Drei {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Schemata de articulis fidei}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 dabei Merkverse \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Essen persone natura gracia glori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Concipe nasci pati des surgit et as venietque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

