\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Heinrich Seuse}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Horologium sapientiae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Voraus Schreibervers Colophons Nr. 23326. Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sentite de domino ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Sap 1,1 f.]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Multifarie multisque modis olim in primitiva ecclesia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hanc amavi ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Sap 8,2]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Erat quidam iuvenis deo notus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... in decore suo conspicientes Ihesum Christum dominum nostrum qui cum patre ... seculorum. Amen. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur tabula tocius libri: Qualiter quidam electi ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [lediglich Beginn der Tabula zu Lib. 1; Ed. K\u252 \'fcnzle, s.u., S. 372, Z. 1\endash 5; diese Tabula 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\endash b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  vollst\u228 \'e4ndig]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit liber horologii eterne sapiencie compilatus a venerabili et devoto fratre videlicet Henrico Suse ordinis predicatorum conventus Constantiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et scriptus per manus Florencii filii Gherardi Spronc anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 x\u176 \'b0 quarta feria post Victoris et sociorum eius post meridiem hora nona vel quasi. Deo gracias. Orate pro scriptore. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [In Rot:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finito libro. Sit laus et gloria. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \endash  Ed.: P. K\u252 \'fcnzle, Heinrich Seuses Horologium sapientiae, Fribourg 1977 (Spicilegium Friburgense, 23), S. 363\endash 605 (Hs. genannt S. 13, 15, 131, 226, 328\endash 131; Sigle Ds); vgl. auch J. Strange, Henrici Susonis seu fratris Amandi (\u8224 \'86 a. 1365) Horologium sapientiae, K\u246 \'f6ln 1861 (Ed. unter Verwendung vorliegender Hs. als Sigle D, vgl. S. 5). Kaeppeli Nr. 1852; Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 5416 mit Suppl. Perger Nr. 101.3; Cardelle de Hartmann S. 554\endash 559. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 8, Sp. 1109\endash 1129, bes. 1116 f., 1123 f. \endash  67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

