\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Collationes quinque cum quaestione logicali}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Voraus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In nomine domini Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Notabilia valde.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < Collatio de peccatis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ecce enim iniquitatibus conceptus sum etc. Verba scripta sunt in psalmo etc. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Ps 50,7]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Gloriosus deus a quo est omne datum optimum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pulcher sermo de indulgenciis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Volumus igitur ut omnes visitantes ecclesiam etc. Verba scripta sunt in litteris pape. Omnes remissiones peccatorum et indulgencie cum aliis spiritualibus beneficiis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sermo primus de inclinacionibus hominum et quinque sensibus satis pulcher.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nolite fieri sicut equus ..., scribit propheta in psalmo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Ps 31,9]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Ad clariorem intellectum et introductionem istorum verborum adduci potest ista parabola}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sermo de quatuor virtutibus cardinalibus satis pulcher secundus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pugna pro patria, scribit venerabilis Katho. Quidam pugnant pro rebus temporalibus ad defendendam rem publicam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Movetur questio loycalis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Movetur questio utrum omnis proposicio vera habet unam adequatam et complexam correspondenciam in re sue veritatis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sermo pulcher quoniam habitus viciosi et promptitudines male ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [s]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tirpanda sunt.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Exerce studium, scribit Katho. Egidius super primo Elencorum dicit quod artes et sciencie non inveniuntur nisi per continuum exercicium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... perveniendi ad summum bonum ad quod factus est. Ad quod nos perducat qui sine fine vivit et regnat. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Bis auf die Quaestio (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) auch Frankfurt/M. Ms. Praed. 129, 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , dort Entstehungsort (\u8222 \'84in castro Rone regni Swecie\ldblquote ) und -jahr (1305) angegeben. Homogene Sammlung mit Nennung zahlreicher antiker und mittelalterlicher Autorit\u228 \'e4ten, besonders {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Anselmus Cantuariensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Die \u220 \'dcberschriften sind Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge eines der Schreiber des Inhaltsverzeichnisses auf dem Vorsatz (s.o.), dort von seiner Hand Titelansetzung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item collationes alique notabiles valde.}

