\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thomas de Cantiprato}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 :{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bonum universale de apibus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Alphabetische Tabula; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis; (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Epistola: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit prologus in librum qui dicitur bonum universale de apum proprietatibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et primo de prelatis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Reverendo in Christo patri fratri Humberto magistro}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber apum qui dicitur bonum universale. Quod Christus est summus prelatus ecclesie cui omnes prelati obedire tenentur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Unum capud Christum in unitate ecclesie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... Rex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 inquit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 apum mellei coloris est ... Quid in melle nisi morum sinceritas? ... \endash  ... vel aliis umquam meruerim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 illum tanquam me participem faciat Christus Ihesus dominus noster qui cum patre ... Amen. Deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit liber apum qui dicitur bonum universale completus anno domini 1460\u176 \'b0 die 24\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  mensis Aprilis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Verse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Compleo Lambertus dum scandit ad astra Lugerus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [recte: Liudgerus] / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hinc lector rogo te: Pro me fundas semel ave\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \endash  Verglichener Druck: Thomae Cantipratani ... bonum universale de apibus, Douai 1627. Kaeppeli Nr. 3775 (Hs. genannt); Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 6157 mit Suppl. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 9, Sp. 839\endash 851. \endash  163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

