\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guido de Monte Rocherii}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Manipulus curatorum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In isto libello sunt tres particule et prima continet in se septem tractatus. Primus prime partis de sacramentis in generali ... \endash  ... >Et sic est huius tabule finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dedikationsbrief: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Reverendo in Christo patri ac domino domino Raymundo divina providencia sancte sedis Valencie episcopo suorum devotorum minimus Guido de monte Rotherij}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Scriptum Turoli anno domini MCCCXXXIII. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit prologus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quoniam secundum quod dicit propheta Malachias, ymmo dominus per Malachiam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit libellus, qui dicitur Manipulus curatorum, qui habet tres partes.< Dividitur ergo presens opusculum in tres partes, in quarum prima agitur de sacramentis \u8230 \'85 >Capitulum primum de institucione sacramentorum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sciendum ergo, quod omnia sacramenta nove legis fuerunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cuius regni concives nos faciat rex regum et dominus dominancium Jhesus Christus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De fine huius operis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec circa officium curatorum breviter a me perscripta sunt \u8230 \'85 et pro me peccatore ad dominum preces fundat. Amen. >Explicit Manipulus Curatorum. Deo gracias. Finitum et completum per me Hinricum Nederceyrn sub anno domini millesimo quadringesimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quinquagesimo tercio in vigilia omnium sanctorum.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: GW 11716\endash 11833. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 5019 mit Suppl. (Hs. genannt); Stegm\u252 \'fcller RS Nr. 277. Schulte GQ Bd. 2, S. 429 f. Zur hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. auch H. Santiago-Otero, Manuscritos de autores medievales hispanos I. Madrid 1987 (Medievalia et humanistica, 3), Hss.-Verzeichnis S. 55\endash 59 und 61\endash 66. \endash  167 leer.}

