\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Isaac Syrus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De contemptu mundi}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit liber sancti abbatis Ysaac de Siria De contemptu omnium mundanorum et de contemplacione. Cap. I.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Anima, que deum diligit, in deo solo quietem habet. Anticipa solvere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Ipsi honor et gloria in secula. Amen. >Explicit.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In istis tribus est omnis homo perfectus in vita ista}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 : Operacio, Oracio, Lectio, Meditacio, Psalmodia, Jubilacio. Verba nostra debent esse humilia, vera, utilia. Amen. Explicit liber Ysaac viri religiosi, cuius verba morum sunt instructiva non modicum. Gesta vero ipsius a beato Gregorio describuntur in 3 libro dyalogorum, capitulo 14\u176 \'b0. Deo gracias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: PG 86, Sp. 811\endash 886 (teilweise andere Kapiteleinteilung und Textabweichungen). CPG Nr. 7868; Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 424. Zum Verfasser vgl. DSAM Bd. 7,2, Sp. 2041\endash 2054, bes. Sp. 2053.}

