\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Soliloquium}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [de quatuor mentalibus exercitiis]. \plain \f1\i\scaps\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Soliloquium Boneventure de quatuor excercitiis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 anime et hominis.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Prolog:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Flecto genua mea \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Eph 3,14\endash 19]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Paulus apostolus, vas eterne elevacionis, sacrarium divine sanctificacionis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 omnis desiderii finis et complementum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1. Kapitel: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Quomodo anima exercitabitur mentaliter, ut videat, qualis est foris formata per naturam. Cap. 1. Anima.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dic, queso, o homo, si post devotam invocacionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 siciat caro mea, donec intrem in gaudium dei mei, qui est trinus et unus benedictus in secula. Amen. Et sic est finis huius libri de quatuor exerciciis anime et hominis. Deo gracias. >Explicit soliloquium sive Dyalogus Bone Venture De quatuor exerciis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .< Per manus fratris Alberti Cass \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (recte: Cars) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de Duysseldorp presbyteri Cruciferi conventualis in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Verweis auf D\u252 \'fcsseldorf ?). \endash  Ed.: Bonaventura. Opera omnia, Bd. 8, Quaracchi 1898, S. 28\endash 67 (Hs. genannt in Prolegomena C. I., S. XXIX, Nr. 51). Distelbrink Nr. 23; Stegm\u252 \'fcller RS Nr. 118; Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 2150 mit Suppl. Perger Nr. 83; Cardelle de Hartmann S. S. 393\endash 399. Zum Verfasser vgl. DSAM Bd. 1, Sp. 1768\endash 1843; LMA Bd. 2, Sp. 202\endash 407. \endash  150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 151 leer.}

