\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Zacharias Chrysopolitanus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In unum ex quatuor}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [Ps.-]Ammonii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , liber I et II\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Praefatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De institutione evangelii et differentia ipsius ad legem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Praefatio secunda: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit prefatio una \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ex quatuor.< Matheus cognomento Levi \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Praefatio tertia: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit prefatio Zacharie Crisopolitani in unum ex quatuor.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 U\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 num \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ex quatuor evangelistarum dictis evangelium, claro studio composuit Ammonius Alexandrinus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Admonitio lectori. Kapitelverzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipiunt capitula.< In principio verbum, deus apud deum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prologus Lucae evangelistae: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit prologus Luce.< Quoniam quidem multi conati sunt \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Lc 1,1\endash 4]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Multi non tam numerositate \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Buch I: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit unum ex quatuor seu concordia ewangelistarum.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 n principio ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Io 1\endash 2]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Verbum, id est sapientia nata ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 >Expositionis in vnum ex quatuor liber primus explicit. Incipit secundus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Buch II: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et factum est \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Mt 11,1]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Civitates discipulorum dicit ... \endash  ... prohibere phariseorum panes. >Explicit liber secundus explanationis in unum ex quatuor.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: PL 186, Sp. 11\endash 284. Incipit abweichend; in der \u8222 \'84Admonitio lectori\ldblquote  fehlt der einleitende Text. Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 8400 (Hs. genannt S. 450) mit Suppl. Zum Verfasser vgl. BBKL Bd. 14, Sp. 296 f. (dort weiterf\u252 \'fchrende Literatur); LMA Bd. 9, Sp. 436. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. auch Tr. J. Gerits, Notes sur la tradition manuscrite et imprim\u233 \'e9e du trait\u233 \'e9 \u171 \'abIn unum ex quatuor\u187 \'bb de Zacharie de Besan\u231 \'e7on, in: Analecta Praemonstratensia 42 (1966), S. 276\endash 303 (Hs. genannt S. 290).}

