\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Gerson}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De praeparatione ad missam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Tractatus venerabilis Magistri Johannis Gersoni Cancellarii Parisiensis, sacre theologie doctoris eximii, super materia misse. De preparatione ad celebrationem perceptionemque sacramenti. Consideratio prima. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Precipue ex divino munere et non ex nostra industria seu preparatione reddimur digni misteriorum participatione sacrorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Hec consideratio, si cum sapore interno masticetur, humiliabit nos vehementer \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 et aliis dispensare. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Es folgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Exhortatio ad gratiarum actiones post celebrationem perceptionemque venerabilis sacramenti devotius exhibendas.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Convenit o anima mea misera et ingrata}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 aptare ad susceptionem eius. Si quid digne aut bene spiritus Ihesu fecit nos in presenti tractatulo aut alibi scribere aut colligere inde ipsi soli Ihesu persolvantur gratie. Qui cum patre et cetera. >Explicit Tractatulus venerabilis magistri Johannis Gerson de officio misse.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 9, S. 35\endash 50. Abweichende Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung und -reihenfolge.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

