\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Sancto Theodorico}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistola ad fratres de Monte Dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Bernardus in epistula ad fratres de Monte dei, quod memoria dominice passionis habenda sit singulis diebus a devoto religioso.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Scit quicumque habet sensum Christi quantum cristiane pietati expediat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et in eius membris computaris. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: CCCM 88, S. 225\endash 289, hier 252 f. (par. 115\endash 119). Literatur in der Beschreibung zu Ms. B 156, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

