\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Orationes ante et post missam}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oratio devota a sacerdote ante celebrationem libenter dicenda.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Deus fons pietatis et bonitatis origo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 suscepi indignus. Per Christum dominum. Amen. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Druck: CO Nr. 1215 (hier etwas l\u228 \'e4ngerer Text). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oratio beati Jheronimi a sacerdote post missam legenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Eya, deus meus, parce michi, misero peccatori}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... pro tua misericordia in eternum. Amen. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Druck: Klapper, Schriften, S. 266 f. (mit Abweichungen).}

