\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thomas a Kempis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cantica}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Responsorium pro confortatione voluntatis proprie ad voluntatem dei in adversis.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Serve meus, noli metuere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Opera omnia, Bd. 4, S. 268\endash 272; (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Pro affectu unionis ad deum.< O amor eterne, accende me \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 363 f.; (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De affectu anime ad dei presentiam aspirantis.< O lux videntium \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 334 f.; (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Quomodo anima devota deum querit.< Quem queris, anima mea \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 332; (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De vera requie et consolatione in deo habenda.< Super omnia et in omnibus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 267 f.; (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De vera renunciatione omnium preter Ihesum.< Regnum mundi et omnem ornatum seculi \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd, S. 340 f.; (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incentiumamoris ad dominum.< Fidelis sermo et omni acceptione dignus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 337 f.; (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De amorosa invitatione dei ad dilectionem sui.< O my dilecte, ne elonges a me \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 345 f.; (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De elevatione cordis ad deum.< En amo te deus meus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 346 f.; (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De speculatione dei.< O sanctissime amator hominum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 335 f.; (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <e> \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 consolatione pauperis et desolati.< Ad quem respiciam \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 341 f.; (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De beata virgine Maria sancte amica.< Maria, pudoris sui custos \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 338 f.; (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De commendatione sancti silentii.< Et erit opus iustitie \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 336 f.; (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pro consolatione turturis viduati.< Gaude, gaude, o turtur unice \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 342 f.; (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De adventu Christi et amore eius ad animam se desiderantem.< Ecce quam bonum et quam iocundum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 332 f.; (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Pulcher ympnus sub nota fit porta.< O Ihesu mii dulcissime, spes \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 329 f.; (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Devotus ympnus sub nota en martiris Laurentii.< Celi cives attendite \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 266 f.; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Spera, persevera, sustine: salvaberis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , dieser Spruch auch auf Bl. 117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. U. Bodemann-Kornhaas, Die Kleineren Werke \u8230 \'85 (s. Bl. 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 148\endash 151. Einzelne Texte anderer Herkunft: (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item. Quamvis optata sit laboranti sessio post laborem, est tamen voluntas victrix eorum et cedere nescia Christi servituti \u8230 \'85 >Pro inflammatione amoris.< O amor sapientissime, o amor fortissime, o amor suavissime, o amor benignissime, accende me, ut per te amem te, qui semper in te amasti me. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De laude nominis Ihesu.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In nomine Ihesu omne genu flectatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Phil 2,10]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Non enim nomen aliud datum est \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De vera gloriatione, que est in cruce domini nostri Ihesu Christi.< Michi absit gloriari \u8230 \'85, Per quem michi mundus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Gal 6,14]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Libenter gloriabor in infirmitatibus meis \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [II Cor 12,9\endash 10]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Per quem etc. Cristo confixus sum cruci \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Gal 2,19\endash 20]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Per quem michi mundus etc. Ego enim stigmata \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Gal 6,17]. (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De summo bono.< O summum, o eternum, o incomunicabile bonum supra et infra \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De eodem.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O summum bonum, dilata mentem meam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Consolatio pauperis temptati.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Serve meus, noli timere, quia ego redemi te}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Is 43,1\endash 5]; (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Consolatio in labore.< Nullus labor durus, nullum tempus longum \u8230 \'85 >Pro illuminatione cordis.< O incommunicabilis veritas \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Pro collatione cordis dispersi in unum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vanitas vanitatum et omnia vanitas: preter amare deum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Anfang vgl. Thomas a Kempis, De imitatione Christi, lib. 1, cap. 1, in: Opera omnia, Bd. 2, S. 6, Z. 11 f.}

