 S. 319, Z. 9\endash 14. (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Idem ad Wernerum Novitium.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ne estimes umquam \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 271, Z. 8\endash 12. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Idem ad Helinandum novitium.< Qui putat sibi melius esse ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., Bd. 3, S. 233 f., Z. 46\endash 49. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Idem ad Robertum Zeyt.< Nec hostis noster illis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., Bd. 4, S. 135, Z. 14\endash 19. (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Idem ad Cestrenses monachos.< Certissimum namque est \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 137, Z. 21\endash 27. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Idem ad congregationem Baccensem.< De ordine vestro \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., Bd. 5, S. 398, Z. 24\endash 29. (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Idem ad Mechtildem Abbatissam.< Pulchritudo certe mentis ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., Bd. 4, S. 70 f, Z. 27\endash 33. (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item Ancelmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si oraveris pro proximo tuo \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., Bd. 3, S. 102, Z. 21 f. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Idem. Qui vivit \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., Bd. 5, S. 367, Z. 22 f\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Idem. Sicut ignis ardens vento \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 255, Z. 7 f. Sharpe Nr. 120, hier S. 60; CALMA 1,3, S. 290, Nr. 13. Es folgen \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Auctoritates. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Idem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nulli tantum timet diabolus appropinquare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ps.-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Anselmus Cantuariensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De pace et concordia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , PL 158, Sp. 1017; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Idem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Equus, cum bene currat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hildebertus Lavardinensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistolae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , PL 171, Sp. 156; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Boetius: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Non sufficit, quod ante oculos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Boethius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De consolatione philosophiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  2, P1, CC 94, S. 18, Z. 40.}

