\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Excerpta, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 auctoritates, dicta, versus. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Beatus Augustinus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O amor, qui semper ardes et numquam extingueris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... quia tam caro pretio te redemit etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Textkompilation: Texte von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (u.a. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Confessiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-Augustinus }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 sowie Zitate aus Werken anderer Autoren. Dieser Text ist auch in Ms. B 156, Bl. 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u252 \'fcberliefert. Vgl. Kurz, Augustinus, 5,1, S. 491 (\u8222 \'84oratio\ldblquote ). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Idem in epistola ad Macedonium.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quid eligamus, quod precipue diligamus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Augustinus, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistulae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , PL 33, Sp. 672.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tu spiras, ubi vis, tu munera dividis, ut vis. Das, cui vis, quod vis, qualiter vis, tempore quo vis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Walther I Nr. 19536; RH Nr. 20705. (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abbas Nesteros:< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Omnis cogitatio non solum turpis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Cassianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Collationes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , PL 49, Sp. 974; (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Item vehemens est vis amoris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 didicit nichil amare.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Richardus de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De gradibus caritatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , PL 196, Sp. 1195\endash 1208 (Exzerpte aus verschiedenen Kapiteln); (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Si possem, quod amo, nec deficerem amando. Defectus amoris interitus est virginei floris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Speculum virginum, CCCM 5, S. 128, Z. 426 f.; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Augustinus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Amor non capit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 nulla impossibilitate refrenatur; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O felix animus, qui non est pondere pressus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 culmina rerum; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Thomas: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Inter omnia hominum studia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 gaudium et leticiam, Sapientie viii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Idem in Prologo: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Multitudinis usus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 pigmentaria conficiuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Exzerpte aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summa contra gentiles}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , lib. 1, cap. 2 und cap. 1 (jeweils Anf\u228 \'e4nge), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Opera omnia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Ed. Leonina), Bd. 13, Rom 1918, S. 6 und 3; in Rot:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Desiderati prohibitio fructus dulcior est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Au\u223 \'dferdem genannte Quellen: Augustinus, sanctus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Franciscus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[6].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Beatus Ignatius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Vita), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[7].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Maximianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[8].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bernardus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[9].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Leo papa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[10].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Biblia. Weitere Initien im Register.}

