\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Auctoritates, dicta, excerpta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 : Via \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (recte: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 vis) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 desideriorum facit toleranciam laborum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 pacienter toleramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Augustinus-Zitat ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De patientia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , cap. 4, CSEL 41, S. 666) mit kurzem Kommentar. (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Volenti in sancta religione proficere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 repleverit maturitas. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Conradus Eberbacensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Exordium magnum Cisterciense}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  6, 2, Z. 174\endash 231, CCCM 138, S. 396 ff. (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gregorius}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gustato spiritu desipit omnis omnis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [!] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 caro, id est omnis carnalis affectio, sed et post gustum mellis omnia alia videntur insipida}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Deus nempe illam animam frequenter visitat \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 replebitur anima eius. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Thema: Bedeutung und Wirkung von Gebet und Kontemplation. (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Corda multorum deo servientium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et laqueos temptationum evadere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Thema: Bedeutung der geistigen St\u228 \'e4rke bei Versuchungen; anschlie\u223 \'dfend:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bernardus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ordo preposterus ante meritum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Leclercq/Rochais, Bd. 2, S. 58, Z. 22 f. Au\u223 \'dferdem genannte Autoren und Quellen: Augustinus, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hugo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Seneca}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[6].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Cassianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Weitere Initien im Register.}

