\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guilelmus Peraldus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summa de vitiis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus iste continet novem partes. Prima est de hiis, que valent ad detestationem vicii in communi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (\u8230 \'85)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dicturi de singulis viciis, cum oportunitas se offeret}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 locutum esse aliquando penituit, tacuisse vero numquam. Et illud: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nam nulli tacuisse nocet, nocet esse locutum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Walther II Nr. 15850)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Et sic est finis deo laus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht. \endash  Druck: GW 12051\endash 12057. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 1628 mit Suppl.; Kaeppeli Nr. 1622 A. Weiterf\u252 \'fchrende Literatur in DSAM Bd. 6, Sp. 1234; R. Newhauser, A Catalogue of Latin Texts with Material on the Vices and Virtues in Manuscripts in Hungary, Wiesbaden 1996 (Gratia, 29), S. 57 und 86. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 118, 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Exzerpt in Ms. B 107c, 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

