\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Heinrich Seuse}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Horologium Sapientiae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit prologus in librum, qui intitulatur Horologium eterne sapientie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sentite de deo \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Sap 1,1 f.]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Multifarie multisque modis olim in primitiva ecclesia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 omnibus deum diligentibus communicari precepit. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula zu Buch I: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item alius prologus super primo libro tantum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Materia primi huius libri est Christi passio preciosissima \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quem habuit in passione filii.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Buch I: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Qualiter quidam electi et divina gracia preventi ad deum mirabiliter trahuntur et specialiter quomodo quidam iuvenis fuerit tractus. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hanc amavi \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Sap 8,2]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Erat quidam iuvenis deo notus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et ad illam celestem Iherusalem cum gaudio perducantur. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Es folgt direkt danach Tabula zu Buch II: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tituli capitulorum secundi lib\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <ri>.< (...) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit secundus liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De diversitate ammiranda doctrinarum atque discipulorum. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sapienciam omnium antiquorum exquirebat quidam avidus sapiencie discipulus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Jhesum Christum, dominum nostrum, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivis et regnas per omnia secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Cursus de aeterna sapientia:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quicumque desiderat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85\endash  \u8230 \'85 Eterna sapientia benedicat et custodiat corda et corpora nostra. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: P. K\u252 \'fcnzle, Heinrich Seuses Horologium sapientiae, Fribourg 1977 (Spicilegium Friburgense, 23), S. 363\endash 605 (Hs. genannt S. 131, 226, Anm. 3, S. 279, 324; Sigle Ds\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). Kaeppeli Nr. 1852; Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 5416 mit Suppl; Perger Nr. 101.3; Cardelle de Hartmann S. 554\endash 559. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 8, Sp. 1109\endash 1129, bes. 1116 f. Werk \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 132, 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und Ms. B 144, 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (mndl.). \endash  123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

