\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Isidorus Hispalensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sententiae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Vorangestellt: (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis zu B\u252 \'fcchern 1\endash 3; (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Namensregister zum Werk \u8222 \'84Allegoriae quaedam sacrae scripturae\ldblquote  (s.u.). (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber primus beati Ysidori episcopi de summo bono< \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber 1; (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber 2; (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber 3. Schluss: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt libri beati Ysidori episcopi Hyspalensis de summo bono anno domini M cccc lxx in festo sancti Petri ad cathedram \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (= 22. Febr.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 completi per me fratrem Gerhardum Messynck de Dyngeden presbiterum conventualem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Conventus Mariepacis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. \endash  Ed.: CC 111. D\u237 \'edaz y D\u237 \'edaz Nr. 111; CPL Nr. 1199; CPPM Bd. 3, Nr. 161.}

