\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Antoninus Florentinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Confessionale \lquote Defecerunt}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \rquote \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Recensio brevior. (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prologus super tractatum de instructione seu directione simplicium confessorum editum a domino Anthonio archiepiscopo florentino.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Defecerunt scrutantes \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Ps 63,7]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , ait psalmista. Scrutantes aliorum peccata sunt confessores}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  ... et indulgenciam tibi concessam a domino papa pro ultimo articulo mortis tue. In nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen. >Explicit Summa confessionum seu interrogatorium pro simplicibus confessoribus editum ab archiepiscopo florentino videlicet fratre Anthonino ordinis predicatorum.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck (zusammen mit dem Sermo de poenitentia, s.u.): GW 2080\endash 82; 2085; 2091\endash 94; 2096; 2098 (Vorlage dieser Abschrift war wahrscheinlich Nr. 2080: [K\u246 \'f6ln: Ulrich Zell, nicht nach 1469]). Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 1501 mit Suppl.; Kaeppeli Nr. 256 A (Hs. genannt); CALMA Bd. 3,1, S. 299, Nr. 2. Schulte GQ Bd. 2, S. 445; LThK\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 1, Sp. 784; Michaud-Quantin S. 73 ff.}

