\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Arnulfus de Boeriis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Speculum monachorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Speculum beati Bernardi abbatis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \endash  Druck: PL 184, Sp. 1175\endash 1178 (Text stellenweise abweichend; eine Passage, beginnend mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sit monachus quasi Melchisedech \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 umgestellt; Schluss fehlt). Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 5582 mit Suppl. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 11, Sp. 137 f.; Bernards, Speculum virginum, S. 5, Anm. 41 (Hs. genannt); anschlie\u223 \'dfend Exzerpte: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bernardus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Musce morientes perdunt suavitatem, non tamen substanciam vel premium nisi eis consensus adhibeatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... et statim ut nascuntur, moriuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Bernardus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nulla dampnacio est hijs, qui sunt in Christo Ihesu}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... et hoc remedio curabuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Sermo 1 de ascensione Domini. Leclercq/Rochais Bd. 5, S. 125. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in tractatu parvum boni: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Omnis meditacio sapientis aut est circa opera humana meditando vel cogitando}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quia hic finis omnis operacionis et meditacionis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

