\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Meditationes et excerpta de extremo iudicio. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardus de Zutphania}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De spiritualibus ascensionibus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , cap. 20. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Generales meditaciones de extremo iudicio, quibus homo sibi potest incutere timorem.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Deinde oculum mentalem verte ad extremum iudicium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  ... et forma meditaciones ex premissis suo modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: Legrand (s. o.), S. 166\endash 171. (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [Ps.-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Beda Venerabilis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De quindecim signis diem iudicii praecedentibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De quindecim ante diem iudicii.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Beatus Jheronimus in annalibus Hebreorum invenit xv signa dierum ante diem iudicii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et resurgent omnes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 94, Sp. 555 (Text gek\u252 \'fcrzt und stellenweise abweichend). CPL Nr. 1129; CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 407; Lambert Bd. 3B, Nr. 652. (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quando extremum iudicium ex omni sui parte erit terribile et quale iudicium habebunt hii, qui presunt.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hoc namque iudicium erit horribile ex omni parte}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 omnes qui preestis populis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Quales esse debeant officiales et iudices principum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quales autem iudices et officiales principum esse debeant, qui populo presunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , docet Yetro, sacerdos Madyan, Moysen, Exodi xviii, dicens: Esto tu populo \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Ex 18,19\endash 22]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .>Exhortacio domini Ihesu ad timendis futurum iudicium.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Propter que omnia cavenda dominus dicit, Luce xxi}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 : }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Attendite autem vobis \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Lc 21,34\endash 36]}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Unde Iheronymus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quociens diem illum considero toto corde contremisce}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et venite ad iudicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

