\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Meditationes, excerpta et auctoritates de paenis \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 infernalibus\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardus de Zutphania}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De spiritualibus ascensionibus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , cap. 21. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Qualiter homo per memoriam penarum infernalium timorem acquirit et compunctionem.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Deinde verte oculum interiorem ad regionem dampnatorum }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  ... a rebus infimis et mundanis avellas. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: Legrand (s. o.), S. 170\endash 177. (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De penis inferni auctoritates.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Secundum beatum Jheronimum tanta erat in inferno vis doloris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 a divina iusticia est penitus negata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Caesarius [Heisterbacensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dialogus miraculorum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ], \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 dist. 12, cap. 5. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Exemplum terribile \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de pena cuiusdam comitis Juliacensis. Cesarius.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Miles quidam nomine Walterus in villa Enthenig iuxta Bunnam habitans infirmabatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 eiulatu magno disparuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: J. Strange, K\u246 \'f6ln (u.a.) 1851, 2 Bde., Bd. 2, S. 318\endash 321 (Text gek\u252 \'fcrzt).}

