\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Meditationes, dicta et exempla de regno caelorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardus de Zutphania}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De spiritualibus ascensionibus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , cap. 24. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Generalis modus formandi meditationes de regno celorum, ad habendam compunctionem ex amore et desiderium ad ipsum obtin<endum>.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Poteris autem de celesti illa patria similitudines sensibiles assumere }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et quidquid nolueris, non habebis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: Legrand (s. o.), S. 182\endash 187. (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De gloria celesti auctoritates.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Secundum beatum Augustinum et Gregorium tanta est in regno celorum pulchritudo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et merces sine fine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Unde Augustinus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O anima mea, si cottidie oporteret nos pati tormenta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ad populum accinctum nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-Hugo de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De anima}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . PL 177, Sp. 178. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Unde et {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Omnia agamus, ut non ab illa gloria excidamus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Caesarius Heisterbacensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dialogus miraculorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], dist. 5, cap. 10. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Exemplum de demone \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quid pati vellet, ut ad celum reverti posset.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In ecclesia sancti Petri in Colonia dum <femina> quedam obsessa miserabiliter a demone tormentaretur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut ad gloriam in qua fui redire possem. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ed.: J. Strange (s.o.), Bd. 1, S. 290 (Text gek\u252 \'fcrzt). (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De dulcedine gaudii celestis exemplum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quidam monachus rogavit deum, ut daret sibi sentire aliquid de dulcedine patrie celestis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quando ille exivit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . F. C. Tubach, Index exemplorum. A handbook of medieval religious tales, Helsinki 1969 (FF communications, 86 = 204), Nr. 3378.}

