\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Meditationes de beneficiis dei. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardus de Zutphania}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De spiritualibus ascensionibus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ], \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 cap. 25. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Item. Qualiter homo ex memoria beneficiorum dei inflammetur ad devocionem et accendatur ad compunctionem.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Verum ut maiorem habeas fiduciam sperandi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 tanto tribuit affectu et amore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: Legrand (s. o.), S. 186\endash 193; anschlie\u223 \'dfend ein Exzerpt zu diesem Thema: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Quid velit deus a nobis pro beneficiis collatis.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sanctus Moyses eminantis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 (?) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 multis beneficiis filiis Israhel a deo prestitis ait illis: Et nunc Israhel \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Dt 10,12\endash 14]}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Excerpta varia et exempla de amore dei. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Hinc beatus Augustinus.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O anima mea, dilige illum, qui tibi dedit celum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ad celestem Iherusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-Augustinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Manuale}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . PL 40, Sp. 961 (Anfang gek\u252 \'fcrzt). (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De amore dei Augustinus libro x confessionum suarum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Domine, amo te}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... ut sint inexcusabiles. Minus enim te amat \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quod non propter te amat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Exzerpte aus: Augustinus, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Confessiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . CC 27, S. 158 und 176. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >In eodem.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O amor, qui semper ardes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quia tam caro precio te redemit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Kompilation aus kurzen Zitaten von Augustinus (\u8222 \'84Confessiones\ldblquote  und andere Werke), Ps.-Augustinus und anderen Autoren. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 147, 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , vgl. Beschreibung. (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Descriptio veri amoris.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Fulgencius in libro de gestis Romanorum dicit, quod Romani depinxerunt amorem sic}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et elevati a terra. Et hec descriptio veri amoris, que continet in se octo. Primum, quod verus amor inter amicos non debet senescere \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et cum deo finiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Basierend auf Robert Holcots \u8222 \'84Moralitates\ldblquote , Kap. 26; vgl. Roberti Holkothi \u8230 \'85 Moralizationum historiarum sive explicationum moralium (...) Liber unus ..., [s. l.] 1586, S. 731; vgl. Sharpe Nr. 1475, hier S. 555; anschlie\u223 \'dfend Exzerpte zu diesem Thema. Genannte Quellen: Johannes, Epistula canonica (Paraphrase von I Io 4,20), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gregorius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ex revelacionibus beate Mechtildis virginis.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quisque ergo vult deum diligere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et votiva memoria passionis Christi et beneficiorum eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Mechthild von Hackeborn}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber specialis gratiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , lib. 1, cap. 17, Sanctae Mechtildis Liber specialis gratiae, Poitiers/Paris 1877, S. 51.}

