\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De paenitentia et elemosina}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 (Excerpta, versus, hymnus, oratio)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De vera et salubra penitencia agenda. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Crisostomus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sicut armemus nos bonis operacionibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 racionem in iudicio. Unde Crisostomus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nichil ita conglutinat deo ut lacrime}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 pro cunctis actibus redditurus. Hec Crisostomus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Valde autem periculosum est, quod peccator in sordibus peccatorum et in morte anime iacet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 quam omnia beneficia predicta per eum facta vel sibi impensa. Hec in vita domini Ihesu capitulo xliiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Idcirco secundum consilium beati Augustini. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Age penitenciam, dum sanus es}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 dimitte incertum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-Augustinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sermones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (sermo app. 393). PL 39, Sp. 1715. CPL Nr. 285; CPPM Bd. 1, Nr. 758. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Quid sit penitencia.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Est autem penitencia, ut ait Ambrosius, mala preterita plangere et plangenda iterum non commitere. Gregorius: Penitere est ante acta peccata deflere \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et adhuc estibus avaricie anhelat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gregorius I. papa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Homiliae in evangelia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , hom. 34. CC 141, S. 314 f. (Wortlaut ver\u228 \'e4ndert). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Isidorus: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Irrisor est penitens, qui adhuc agit quod penitet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Isidorus Hispalensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sententiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . CC 111, S. 128\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ambrosius}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vera penitencia est cessare a peccato}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Pius papa: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nichil prodest ieiunare et orare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 vere penitet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pius I. papa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Decreta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . PL 130, Sp. 112. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Unde Augustinus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cavendum est ne quis existimet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 propiciandus est deus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Augustinus, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Enchiridion de fide, spe et caritate}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , cap. 19. CC 46, S. 87. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Consilium Danielis prophete ad regem Nabuchodonosor Danielis 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  de utilitate elem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (osynae)<. Dn 4, 24. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item de elemosina ecclesiastici xxix\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Sir 29,15\endash 16; Sir 29,18 (?). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sed oportet secundum Crisostomum, quod elemosina huiusmodi non sit cum iniquitate acquisita}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et orate pro hiis, quipersequuntur vos. Non ergo tardos vel dissimulos in sanitate penitenciam agere et cito peccati onus deponere, ut ait Augustinus. Stultum est in illo statu vivere \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 excedit omnem penam temporalem vite huius. Unde {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[7].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bernardus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Judicent (?) et sentiant alii ut volunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 transtulit dominus peccatum tuum a te. >Sequitur versus notabiles quid sit vere penitenciam agere. In vita domini. Capitulo de penitencia.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sit tibi potus aqua, cibus aridus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 addicat iudicis ira. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Walther I Nr. 18341; Walther II Nr. 29869. (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ymnus devotus ad penitenciam excitativus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Utamur ergo partius verbis, cibis et potibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 unus deus cognomine. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . AH Bd. 51, Nr. 55 (beginnend mit Strophe 3); RH Nr. 5610. (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De eodem oracio.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Terret me tota vita mea}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 indulgentia tua est domine deus meus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Anfang vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[8].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Anselmus Cantuariensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Meditatio ad concitandum timorem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in: Opera omnia, Ed. F. S. Schmitt, Bd. 3, S. 76; darunter und 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Federproben und Kritzeleien. \endash  107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

