\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (1) 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Chrysostomus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De sacerdotio libri VI}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber dyalogorum sancti Johannis Crisostomi, Constantinopolitani episcopi et sancti Basilii, Cesariensis episcopi, college beati Gregorii Nazanzeni. De dignitate sacerdocii liber primus. Johannes.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Michi quidem multi fuerunt amici certi et amicicie iura scientes solidesque servantes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 in eternum tuum recipias tabernaculum. Amen. Explicit liber dyalogorum sancti Johannis Crisostomi et sancti Basilii Cesariensis episcopi de dignitate sacerdocii. Per fratrem Andream Poelman de Arnhem. Anno domini M cccc lxxxiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in festo sancti Servacii episcopi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (= 13. Mai)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , de sero post completorium, circa horam octavam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Hain 5048 f.; PG 48, Sp. 623\endash 692 (hier andere \u220 \'dcbersetzung). CPG Nr. 4316; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 21168. Kristeller S. 522; van den Bosch, Observantie, S. 136, Anm. 20 (Hs. jeweils genannt).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (2) 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Matthaeus de Cracovia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dialogus rationis et conscientiae de frequenti usu communionis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Exhortacio sive dyalogus reverendi magistri Mathei de Cracovia, doctoris sacre theologie Parisiensis, de eukaristia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit capitulum primum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Multorum tam clericorum quam laycorum querela est non modica}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 pro viatico datum est nobis corpus domini nostri Ihesu Christi. Qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit et regnat in secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit exhortacio sive dyalogus reverendissimi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 magistri Mathei de Cracovia, doctoris sacre theologie Parisiensis, de disceptacione consciencie et racionis de sacramento eukaristie multum bona \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 valde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per fratrem Andream Poelman de Arnhem. Anno domini M. cccc et lxxxi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in festo Dyonisii Rustici et Eleutherii martirum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (= 9. Okt.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , infra secundam et terciam horam ante vesperas.< O bone, non ride. Si scis bene scribere, scribe, quia sunt derisores derisis deteriores \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (vgl.\plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 Colophons Nr. 22659). \endash  Ed.: W. Se\u324 \'f1ko / A. L. Szafra\u324 \'f1ski, Mateusza z Krakowa Opuscula theologica dotycz\u261 \'b9ce spowiedzi i komunii, Warszawa 1974 (Textus et studia historiam theologiae in Polonia excultae spectantia, 2,1; Materia\u322 \'b3y do historii teologii \u347 \'9credni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 owiecznej w Polsce, 1), S. 367\endash 409. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 3136 mit Suppl.; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 21456; Cardelle de Hartmann S. 681\endash 684. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 132, 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (dort weitere Angaben).}

