\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (2) 228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (= 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Parabolae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1, 2, 5, 6. (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Parabola 1. (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Parabola beati Bernardi abbatis de filio regis.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\endash va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Parabola 5. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Parabola cuius supra de Fide, Spe et Caritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Parabola 6. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Parabola de nupciis filii regis et de ornamentis sponse sue et cetera.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Parabola 2. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De gwerra inter Babilonem et Iherusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< Schlussrubrik: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finiunt parabole beati Bernardi abbatis Clarevallis. Ego, frater Johannes Wistorpp, complevi hunc libellum ipso die Blasii episcopi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (= 3. Febr.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , dum confessoris teneo nomen apud sanctimoniales in Kenttorpp. Anno 1472, dum eciam cerneretur perlucide in astris cometa.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: Leclercq/Rochais Bd. 6,2, S. 261\endash 267 (Parabola 1); S. 267\endash 273 (Parabola 2, hier abweichend); S. 282\endash 285 (Parabola 5); S. 288\endash 295 (Parabola 6). Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 2783, 5198, jeweils mit Suppl., und Nr. 5201; CALMA Bd. 2,3, S. 306 f., Nr. 9. H.-M. Rochais, Enqu\u234 \'eate sur les sermons divers et les sentences de Saint Bernard, Rom 1962 (Analecta sacri ordinis Cisterciensis, 18; Fasc. 3\endash 4), S. 27\endash 43, Parabola 2 in der Fassung wie ebd. S. 37\endash 40;anschlie\u223 \'dfend: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hieronymus [Aleph}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Astrologische Weissagung f\u252 \'fcr das Jahr 1472}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Judicium timendum valde super predictam stellam. Universis, ad quos presentes pervenerint, Magister Jheronimus, philosophus Erphordie, alii philosophii concordantes pacem sempiternam \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Datum Erphordie per numerum dierum xv mensis decembris. Sicut egomet inveni, rescripsi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Thorndike/Kibre Sp. 1603.}

