\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (4) 233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (= 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Galandus Regniacensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Parabolarium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], Exzerpt (Parabola 18: Quae sit regina omnium virtutum). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur parabola, quomodo omnes virtutes convenerunt in unum, ut unam preponerent omnibus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Omnes virtutes convenerunt aliquando in unum, ut ex seipsis unam in reginam sibi eligerent}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 valedicens eis in viam pacis omnes abierunt. >Explicit hec parabola pulcherrima. Finivi in Kentorp, anno domini 1472, feria vero quarta post Oculi mei \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (= 4. M\u228 \'e4rz)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , hora quasi sexta de sero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \endash  Ed.: SC 378, S. 294\endash 321, hier bis S. 317. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 3627 f. mit Suppl. \endash  33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

