\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Richardus de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Mysticae annotationes in Ps 28}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog: [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Ps.-Richardus de Sancto Victore: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Explicatio in Cantica canticorum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Cap. 41. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit prologus magistri Richardi super psalmum \u8218 \'82Afferte\rquote .< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (\u8230 \'85) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Explicit prologus. Incipit tractatus magistri Richardi de sancto Victore super psalmum \u8218 \'82Afferte\rquote .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text. Schlussrubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Explicit tractatus magistri Richardi de Sancto Victore super psalmum \u8218 \'82Afferte domino\rquote  etc.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: PL 196, Sp. 521\endash 522 (Prolog); PL 196, Sp. 285\endash 308 (Text). Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 7326 (Hs. genannt). R. Goy, Die handschriftliche \u220 \'dcberlieferung der Werke Richards von St. Viktor im Mittelalter, Turnhout 2005 (Bibliotheca Victorina, 18), S. 318, Nr. 16 (diese Hs.); van den Bosch, Observantie, S. 135, Anm. 16 (Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt). Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 21, 254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und Ms. B 30a, 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (vgl. Kat. D\u252 \'fcsseldorf S. 104 und 132 f.).}

