\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Henricus de Langenstein}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistula [de contemptu mundi ad Eberhardum de Yppelbrunn}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit epistola magistri Heynrici de Hassia ad decanum maioris ecclesie Maguncinensis.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amicorum sincerissimo virtutis et sciencie meritis reverendo domino E. de Yppelborn, ecclesie Magundinensis decano, H. Langensteyn, dictus de Hassia, suorum minimus felici prosperitate vivere et fecundis successibus semper habundare. In domino prekarissime: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Audiens nuper de digniori promocione vestre persone honorande}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 fortunam suis legibus prudenter deter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 mi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 2539; T. Hohmann, Initienregister der Werke Heinrichs von Langenstein, S. 402, Nr. 10, in: Traditio 32, 1976, S. 399\endash 426. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 3, Sp. 763\endash 773; van den Bosch, Observantie, S. 147, Anm. 151 (Hs. genannt). Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 193, 236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

