\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aszetische Texte}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Anleitung zur Meditation\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 zu verschiedenen Tageszeiten)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De mane, quando vigilas de sompno.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quando surgis et statim cum evigilas, omnes cogitaciones abice}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et loquente tibi devote attende\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Post studium.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Item post studium, quando vades ad labores}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 in custodem deputati. >Infra labo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 rem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ><. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Infra laborem potes cogitare, quod labor primo venit propter peccatum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 pro peccatis tuis gravissimis meruisti. >Post missam.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Post missam absque necessitate fuge colloquium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 pre oculis quod debes. >Ad refectorium.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ad refectorium accedens cogites fetorem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 dabitur vermibus ad vorandum. >In mensa.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In mensa disce cor tuum avertere a cibo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et diabolum suggerentem letificet. >Post prandium.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Item post prandium sive cenam festina morose}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 prompcior es ad loquendum quam alio tempore. >In labore.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In labore potes cogitare, quod labores pro fratribus tuis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quia quodcumque uni feceris etc. >Ante vesperas.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Item ante vesperas cogita, quod tot anni etatis tue perditi sunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 deus aderit. >Completorium.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ante completorium cogita de crisorio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 cotidie moriendo. >Post completorium.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Post completorium potes cogitare de illis, in quibus per diem excessisti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 cogitaciones fornicacionis abice. >De colloquio.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In colloquio sive in collacione tamquam iudici assistens in omnibus te habeas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 per eos verbis etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum ad stratum lassus deveneris te honestissime iacendo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ex omnibus viribus tuis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Specialia remedia contra vicia.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Efficatoria remedia contra omnia vicia sunt ista: Primum paupertas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 aliam namque salutem non inveniat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

