\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Excerpta varia ascetica}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Franciscus Assisias}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistula toti ordini missa}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sanctus Franciscus de corpore Christi.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Magna miseria et miseranda infirmitas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 qui se vobiscum exhibet totum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: K. Esser, Die Opuscula des hl. Franziskus von Assisi. Neue textkritische Edition, 2. erw. und verb. Aufl., Grottaferrata (Romae) 1989 (Spicilegium Bonaventurianum, 13), S. 259\endash 263, hier S. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  261. CALMA Bd. 3,4, S. 386, Nr. 9.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Matthaeus de Cracovia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dialogus rationis et conscientiae de frequenti usu communionis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , cap. 12\endash 14. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Nota bonam doctrinam de corpore Christi.< Nota bone \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Non est omnium unus disponendi modus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 pro viatico datum est nobis corpus domini nostri Ihesu Christi, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit et regnat in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 \endash  Ed.: W. Se\u324 \'f1ko\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 / \plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 A. L. Szafra\u324 \'f1ski, Mateusza z Krakowa Opuscula theologica \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (vgl. Beschreibung zu Ms. B 164, 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 367\endash 409, hier S. 406\endash 409. (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-] Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Meditationes de cognitione humanae conditionis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ex meditacionibus beati Bernardi.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dicat autem quis: Non possum mundum spernere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 in supplicium eternum. >Hec beatus Bernardus in meditacionibus.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: PL 184, Sp. 485\endash 508, hier Sp. 491 (Anfang abweichend). \endash  64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

