\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Franciscus Assisias}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Regula bullata}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , mit der Bulle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8218 \'82Solet annuere\rquote  von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Honorius III. }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (29.11.1223). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit bulla sive processus confirmationis ordinis et regule fratrum minorum concessa vel concessus a domino papa Honorio ob rogatum beati Francisci patris.< Honorius, episcopus, servus servorum dei, dilectis filiis, fratri Francisco et aliis fratribus de ordine fratrum minorum, salutem et apostolicam benedictionem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Solet annuere sedes apostolica}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 que talis est: >Incipit regula et vita fratrum minorum edita a beato Francisco. Cap. primum.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Regula et vita fratrum minorum hec est, scilicet domini nostri Jhesu Christi sanctum evangelium observare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quod firmiter promisimus. Nulli ergo omnino hominum licet \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 se noverit incursurum. Datum Laterani, tercio kalendas decembris, pontificatus nostri anno octavo. >Explicit regula beati Francisci litteris confirmacionis eiusdem inserta. Versus: Pro scriptore precem digneris fundere Cristo, ut vitando necem mundo sit mundus ab isto.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: K. Esser, Die Opuscula des hl. Franziskus von Assisi (s.o.), S. 366\endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  371. CALMA Bd. 3,4, S. 388, Nr. 19.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 P. van den Bosch, in: Clairlieu 36, 1978, S. 162 (Hs. genannt). Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 182, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  bis auf zwei Federproben leer.}

