\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Lancea]}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Diaeta salutis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec est via \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Is 30,21]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Magnam misericordiam facit, qui erranti viam ostendit \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primo ergo nota de peccato vel vitio in communi \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et luxuriam per contrarium. Amen. >Explicit liber, qui vocatur dieta salutis. Finitus per fratrem Andream Poelman de Arhnen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 altera die professionis sue, in die annunciacionis dominice ante vesperas. O bone, non ride, si scis bene scribere, scribe. Explicit hic totum, de vino da michi potum.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Colophons Nr. 22659 (1. Vers) und 21016. Daneben Hand einen Becher haltend, in roter Federzeichnung. (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula zum Werk. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Explicit tabula diete salutis. Qui scripsit, sit ille benedictus. Andreas Poelman de Arnhem.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Vgl. Colophons Nr. 23230. \endash  Druck: Bonaventurae Opera omnia, Ed. A. C. Peltier, Bd. 8, Paris 1866, S. 248\endash 358 (mit Abweichungen). Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 2301 mit Suppl.; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 16096; Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 305dd; Distelbrink Nr. 124; Mohan S. 169. B.-G. Guyot, La \u8222 \'84Dieta salutis\ldblquote  et Jean Rigaud, in: Archivum Franciscanum Historicum 82, 1989, S. 378 (Hs. genannt; recte: B 172).}

