\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Haimo Altissio\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 dorensis: Commentarius in Epistu\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 lam Pauli ad Romanos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Am oberen Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Inceptus profesto Symonis et Iud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <e> (= 27. Okt.), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 12\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  hora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ab Athenis, civitate Grecorum vel a Corintho, civitate metropoli Achaie regionis Grecorum, scripsit apostolus Romanis< hanc epistolam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que per totum textum huius epistole scripta sunt. Finita epistola ad Romanos. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: PL 117, Sp. 361\endash 508. Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 3101 und 7233. Zur Verfasserfrage vgl. Glorieux, Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 57.}

