\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Ps.-]Dionysius Areopagita: 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit prologus Johannis Sarraceni ad Oddonem, sancti Dyonisii reverendi abbatem, in librum beati Dyonisii de divinis nominibus.< Memor hospicii et mee sponsionis, diu litteras vestre sublimitatis expectavi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad hanc reor illam referendam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: M. Grabmann, Die mittelalterlichen lateinischen \u220 \'dcbersetzungen, s.o., S. 456. (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\endash vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Epigramma in beatum Dyonisium in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 libro de divinis nominibus.< In animum splendor in divinas scripturas milletingens formas varietatibus sacra nomina et post istam mortem vitalibus sapientie eloquiis tonantibus divinos manifestarios ympnos compresbitero Thymotheo Dyonisius presbiter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 122, Sp. 1111. (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Capitulum primum de divinis nominibus. Que sermonis intencio et que divinis nominibus tradicio.< Nunc autem, o beate, post theologicas ypotiposes, ad divinorum nominum reseracionem, sicut est possibile, transibo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad symbolicam autem theologiam, duce deo, transibimus. >Explicit liber beati Dyonisii de divinis nominibus.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Dionysiaca, Stuttgart-Bad Cannstatt 1989, Bd. 1, S. 5\endash 320 und Bd. 2, S. 321\endash 561. CPG Nr. 6602 mit Suppl. Weitere Angaben vgl. Bl. 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Ps.-]Dionysius Areopagita: De mystica theologia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \u220 \'dcbersetzung von Johannes Sarracenus. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit prologus Johannis Sarraceni ad Oddonem, Dyonisii abbatem, in libro beati Dyonisii de mistica theologia.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ante mysticam theologiam symbolica theologia esset transferenda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et doceo interpretatur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: M. Grabmann, Die mittelalterlichen lateinischen \u220 \'dcbersetzungen, s.o., S. 456 f. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Novam claritatem reliquam et scienciam subsistencium noctem per divinam, quam non iustum nominare. Vel sic: Et sensum refulgentem penetrasti et scienciam existencium noctem per divinam, quam non est fas numerare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \endash  Druck: PL 122, Sp. 1171 (Text abweichend). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Epigrama in librum beati Dyonisii de mistica theologia compresbitero Thymotheo Dyonisius presbiter capittuulum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 primum de mistica theologia.< Trinitas supersubstancialis et superdea et superbona, inspectrix divine sapiencie christianorum, dirige nos ad mysticorum eloquiorum superignotum et supersplendentem et summum verticem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et super tota. >Explicit liber beati Dyonisii de mistica theologia.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Dionysiaca, s.o., Bd. 2, S. 565\endash 602. CPG Nr. 6603 mit Suppl. Weitere Angaben vgl. Bl. 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

