\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 348\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Henricus Millingen}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Expositiones evangeliorum. Sermones de tempore}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominica 1 adventus. Expositio evangelii.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum appropinquaret Ihesus etc. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Mt 21,1]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Evangelium describit Matheus xxi capitulo, ubi dicit, quod dominus noster vadens Iherusalem ad patiendum pro nobis et cum appropinquaret civitati cum discipulis suis, pervenisset Bethphage, id est villam sic dictam, premisit duos discipulos, Petrum scilicet et Philippum dicens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc est in regnis celestibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur sermo primus de quibusdam rationibus, quare incarnatus est deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dicite filie Syon \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Za 9,9; Mt 21,5]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Verba prophetice scribuntur Zacharie ix capitulo, Mathei xxi litteraliter et sumuntur pro presentis sermonis exordio thematisaliter. Et sunt verba valde dulcia ac suavia incitancia nos ad dilectionem dei omnipotentis propter suam incarnationem, que propter varias facta est raciones, ex quibus quinque pro nunc capio declarandas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut electi contemplentur dulcem suavemque humanitatem domini nostri Jhesu Christi. Quod nobis omnibus faveat pater et filius et spiritus sanctus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sermo secundus et potest applicari in festo sancti Andree, cum infra hebdomodam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 prime dominice adventus occurrerit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dicite filie Syon ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Za 9,9; Mt 21,5]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Scribuntur verba Zacharie ix capitulo originaliter, litteraliter aut ponuntur Mathei xxi et dominice precedentis evangelio recitative sumunturque pro nostri presentis sermonis exordio thematisaliter nostri salvatoris adventus iocundos rumores annunciantia. Sicut in processu pa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (tebit) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 etc. Christus Jhesus etc. Charissimi, ut supra. Scitis: Quomodo aliquis positus in captivitate multum gaudet de fama adventus alicuius regis, qui promisit illum liberare \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 hec puncta attendit beatus Andreas, qui Christum dominum perfecte imitatus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (...) (338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In dominica rogacionum expositio evangelii Johannis xvi. Amen, amen, dico vobis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Io 16,23]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Bina vice dixit \u8218 \'82Amen\rquote  in signum maioris firmitatis. Igitur instruebat eos dicens: Petite, scilicet patrem meum, in nomine meo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Triplex est gaudium, scilicet vanum, hoc est gaudium presentis seculi \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quod sis vere filius dei. Sequitur sermo de oratione, quid petendum sit et qualiter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Amen, dico vobis \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Io 16,23]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Verba scribuntur xvi capitulo Johannis litteraliter et in evangelio hodierno et sumuntur pro exordio presentis sermonis nostri thematisaliter. Et sunt verba salvatoris nostri provocantis discipulos suos ad petendum promittens peticionis effectum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \endash  (342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut deus concedat nobis graciam in presenti et gloriam in futuro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quam etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur sermo secundus in eadem dominica. De oracione dominica et aliis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Petite et accipietis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Io 16,24]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 . Verba scribuntur Joh xvi litteraliter et in evangelio presentis dominice et sumuntur pro exordio nostri presentis sermonis thematisaliter. Quibus verbis salvator noster incitat nos ad petendum promittitque peticionis effectum. Sicut patebit in sequentibus per graciam etc. Christus Jhesus etc. Charissimi in Cristo, verba, que proposui, ut supra. Quibus verbis dominus noster hortatur nos ex sua divina bonitate ac largitate, ut petamus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  (345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 ut deus det nobis hic graciam et gloriam in futuro. Quod nobis omnibus etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur alius sermo, qui potest deservire in processione in deportacione beate Marie pro aeris serenitate petenda vel pluvia postulanda et quacumque necessitate.< Si petieritis \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Io 16,23]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Scriptum est thema presens Johannis xvi et in evangelio, etc. Que verba proposita sunt virginis gloriose, pietatis et misericordie matris, nobis iuxta nostra vota in presenti die et hora directa, que verba pro presenti sermone explicabo tribus punctis \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut sancta trinitas nos suscipiat in graciam. Ut hoc fiat, dicamus: Salve regina misericordie. In omni tribulacione cum collecta: O mitissime. Ex quo congregati sumus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis huius libri. Deo laus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \endash  Die vorliegende Sammlung umfasst Predigten vom 1. Adventssonntag bis zum 5. Sonntag nach Ostern (Bestand: T1\endash T18, T18/4, T19\endash T26, T28, 2. feria post die paschae, 3. feria post die paschae, T29\endash T33; Siglen nach Schneyer). Jedem Anlass sind mehrere Predigttexte zugeordnet. Den Predigten zu den jeweiligen Anl\u228 \'e4ssen wurden \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expositiones evangeliorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 vorangestellt. Bl. 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

