\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tabula christianae religionis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tabula christiane religionis valde utilis et necessaria cuilibet christiano, quam omnes scire tenentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ultima enim sunt hec, que unusquisque scire tenentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Isti sunt casus penitenciales papales: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sit simplex, humilis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Walther I Nr. 18330); (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sex opera misericordie secundum animam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; anschlie\u223 \'dfend \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Wersus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Visito, poto, cibo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Walther I Nr. 20647; Walther II Nr. 33805, Vers 1) (\u8230 \'85) \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 libera nos. >Explicit Tabula ad christiane religionis disciplinam anno xiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \endash  Druck: Hain 15213 f. (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Versus continentes x praecepta legis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Isti sunt versus continentes x precepta legis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primum preceptum: Unum cole deum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Qui colit extra deum vel sanctos quodcumque creatum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 nec rem cupias alienam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Walther I Nr. 15425; Bloomfield/Guyot Nr.\~4589).}

