\pard\fi0\li0\tx1440\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Andreas de Escobar}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Modus confitendi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Modus confitendi compositus per reverendum episcopum Andream Hispanum ordinis sancti Benedicti, sancte romane ecclesie penitenciarium. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quoniam omni confitenti necessarium est hanc generalem confessionem dicere et facere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 dico culpam meam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: GW 1769\endash 1814. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 4989 mit Suppl.; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 28453; CALMA Bd. 1,3, S. 238, Nr. 8. Schulte GQ Bd. 2, S. 440 f.; anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item circumstancie peccatorum sunt: Quantitas, qualitas, sexus, condicio, locus, causa, intencio, tempus, mora, dignitas, temptacionis et operacionis modus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec sunt querende a penitentibus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quis, quid, ubi, per quos, cum quibus, cur quomodo, quociens et quando, etas, forma}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , locus, ordo, sapiencia, tempus, sexus, condicio, causa, intencio, mora, eventus et persona ac operis et temptacionis modus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Walther I Nr. 16101 f. (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec sunt medicamina, quibus curatur confessio vestra: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sit simplex, humilis, sit ferve}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 n}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 s}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 ac se punire parata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Walther I Nr. 18330. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

