\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Turrecremata}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Expositio in regulam Sancti Benedicti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. Dem Text vorangestellt sind: 1) Exzerpt aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Benedictus de Nursia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Regula}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 cap. 58, 17\endash 18: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Forma professionis fratrum ordinis Sancti Benedicti et est scripta in regula beati Benedicti capitulo lviii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , ubi dicit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Suscipiendus autem in oratorio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quem irridet. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ed.: CSEL 75, S. 149. CPL Nr. 1852; CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 3605; CALMA Bd. 2,2, S. 210. 2) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Forma professionis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , mit kurzer Auslegung. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Forma professionis hec est: Ego, frater N., promitto stabilitatem et conversionem morum meorum ac obedienciam secundum regulam sancti Benedicti coram deo et sanctis eius in hoc monasterio, quod constructum est honore sancti N., in presencia domini N., abbatis. In qua professione tria substancialia monastice professionis tanguntur \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 stabilitate a girovagis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item dominus Johannes de Turrecrematia dicit: Item. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nullus debet calumniari hanc professionis formam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 inseparabiliter se sociare. Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Hain 15734; Copinger 5893. Kaeppeli Nr. 2723.}

