\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bindus Senensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  (?): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Distinctiones sive concordantiae historiales Veteris et Novi Testamenti}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Abstinentia est virtutis augmentativa, sapientie acquisitiva, carnis refrenativa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Zelus indiscretus est, quando non procedit \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 epistulas in Damascum contra christianos. Act 8. 9. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic est finis. Per me fratrem Iohannem Zutphanie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Register zum Werk: (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula prima; (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur tabula secunda, que reduci debet ad primam tabulam in quacumque materia vel de virtute vel de vicio.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < Schlussrubrik: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit tabula seu concordantia biblie minor. Consummatus et scriptus est iste liber per me fratrem Johannem Zutphanie anno domini M 5 36 in profesto virginis Marie ad nives \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (= 4. Aug.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \endash  Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 135 mit Suppl.; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 618\endash 620; CALMA Bd. 2,4, S. 410; Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 1765, 1419 (Antonius de Rampegollis; vgl. CALMA Bd. 3,2, S. 400, ANT 125, Nr. 1), ebd. Nr. 6436 (Ps.-Petrus de Bruniquello), ebd. Nr. 6940 (Petrus de Utino). Zumkeller Nr. 202 und 115 (Antonius de Rampegollis).}

