\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Brunsvicensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 :\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus de praeparatione missae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit tractatus cuiusdam devoti carthusiensis circa missam et eius devotam preparationem. In nomine domini. Amen.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Exigis a me, dulcissime in domino \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 docebit interior, qua spiritus sanctus cor tuum perfundere dignetur, qui cum patre et filio vivit et regnat per cuncta secula benedictus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 An autem officium misse festinanter vel attractim peragendum sit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ante omnia scire volo tuam caritatem, quod si linguis loquerer}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ad quod nos perducat, qui per omnia secula regnat. Amen. >Explicit Tractatulus de missa et circa eandem devota preparacio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cuisdam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 devoti carthusiensis. Finitus et completus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Randnachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in Amersfoirt in monasterio sancte Agathe opter Spoyen inclusarum ordinis canonicarum regulissarum in domo confessoris me id\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 em\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 > \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 benigne hospitat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per me, Johannem de Tegelen, illustris et nobilis domicelli Enghelberti de Clivis et de Marka, Dyocesis Traiectensis gubernatoris, cappellanum, domicello predicto, in opido Amersfort ad tempus existente, Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 lxxxii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , xii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Junii, que tunc fuit profestum octavarum venerabilis sacramenti, hora quasi tercia post meridiem. Orate pro me.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Vgl. Franz, Messe, S. 598 f.; DSAM Bd. 8, Sp. 313 ff.; VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 4, Sp. 548 ff. \endash  20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

