\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Henricus de Suevia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Queritur utrum mulier tempore et loco confessionis a sacerdote audiens vel videns verba vel gestus viciose libidinis inductiva et suam famam, si aliis publicentur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , eciam quo ad vite honestatem denigrativa sine peccato possit aliis feminis avisando referre.< Salvo judicio semper meliori videtur michi, Henrico de Swevia, in decretis baccalario, in parvitate mei intellectus, quod si mulier huiusmodi predicta verba et gestus referat in forma, qua audivit et vidit \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Supposita protestacione in actibus theoloycis fieri consueta tanquam per me facta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (\u8230 \'85) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primo igitur erit declaranda hec clausula volens, sed non valens honestiori remedio succurere casure \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quae quis prodere non tenetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ||}

