\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De reductione artium ad theologiam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . || \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 abstrahibilium secundum raciones intelligibiles \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 numquam pervenitur ad filium nisi per spiritum sanctum, qui docet nos omnem veritatem; qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. >Explicit libellus sancti Bonaventurae ordinis fratrum minorum de reductione atrium ad theologiam.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: Opera omnia, Bd. 5, Quaracchi 1891, S. 319\endash 325, hier Anfang ab Abschnitt 4, S. 321 (Hs. genannt in Prolegomena S. XXXV). Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 305x; Distelbrink Nr. 3; CALMA Bd. 2,4, S. 454, Nr. 18.}

