\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thomas Vercellensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 (?)] / [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-]Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De septem gradibus contemplationis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sequitur eiusdem venerabilis Bonaventure tractatus de septem gradibus contemplacionis.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Contemplativorum aquilinos obtutus acui \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 castissimo amplexu complexa est, dominum nostrum Ihesum Christum, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. >Explicit tractatus sancti Bonaventurae ordinis fratrum minorum de septem gradibus contemplacionum.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: GW 4644, 4646\endash 4648, 4650. Distelbrink Nr. 107; Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 116g und 305da; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 8597.}

