\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Itinerarium mentis in deum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit prologus Bonaventure in itinerarium mentis in deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In principio primum principium, a quo cuncte illuminationes descendunt \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 sed morosissime ruminandus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Kapitelverzeichnis. (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Speculatio pauperis in deserto. Primum capitulum. De gradibus ascensionis in deum et de speculatione eius per vestigia ipsius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Beatus vir \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Ps 83,6\endash 7]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Cum beatitudo nichil aliud sit, quam summi boni fruitio \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et dicat omnis populus: Fiat, fiat. >Finit Itinerarius mentis in deum beati Bonaventure.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \endash  Ed.: Opera omnia, Bd. 5, Quaracchi 1891, S. 295\endash 313 (Hs. genannt Prolegomena S. XXIX). Distelbrink Nr. 19; Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 2653 mit Suppl.; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 18947; Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 305m; Stegm\u252 \'fcller RS Nr. 119; CALMA Bd. 2,4, S. 456, Nr. 37. Van den Bosch, Observantie, S. 144, Anm. 108; ders. in: Clairlieu 38, 1980, S. 99 (Hs. jeweils genannt). \endash  19 leer.}

