\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Notae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quamvis dicatur, quod Thomas accipit essentiam pro eo, quod recipit esse et Albertus pro eo, quod dat esse \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 hoc album materia totius. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Eintrag in Geheimschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 viva voce audii a Toigeris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \endash  Vgl. Karpp, Ex parte fratris Jordani, S. 410, Anm. 39; zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Arnoldus de Tongern}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  vgl. auch G.-R. Tewes, Die Bursen der K\u246 \'f6lner Artisten-Fakult\u228 \'e4t (s.o.), S. 65. Vgl. Ms. B 177, 352\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 308\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Mechlinia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestiones et dubia in De anima Aristotelis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >1. Utrum sciencia de anima inter naturales philosophie partes convenienter posita est pars sexta.< Et videtur primo contra suppositum, quod non sit aliqua sciencia de anima. Probatur, quia omnis sciencia sive cognitio nostra ostenditur a sensu, sed anima non cadit sub sensu, ergo de ea non est scientia \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >2. Utrum predicta anime scientia inter ceteras naturales magis difficilis sit, utilis ac honesta.< Et videtur primo, quod non sit magis difficilis. Probatur sic: Quia nullum certum videtur esse difficile, sed scientia de anima est certissima \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Circa predicta sunt multa dubia. Primum est: Utrum de anima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sit una scientia.< Et videtur primo, quod non, quia de infinitis non est una scientia, sed anime sunt infinite, ergo de eis non est scientia una \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circa secundum librum de anima moventur quedam questiones et dubia. >1. Utrum preter forma pure naturalem sit catholicum ponere animam eandem in perfectionis gradibus excedentem. Et videtur primo, quod non sit ponenda anima. Probatur per illud Sapien 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  (quod dixerunt impii): Exiguum et cum tedio \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Sap 2,1\endash 3]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ergo videtur, quod principium vite in nobis sit fumus ortus a corde et flatus est in naribus nostris et sermo scintilla ad commovendum cor nostrum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (295\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur tractatus tercius de potentia motiva. In primo capitulo inquirit philosophus disputative, quod sit motus progressivi principium in animalibus. In secundo ostendit, quod sit illud secundum veritatem. In tercio ostendit, quomodo illud principium diversimode reperitur in diversis. >1. Utrum preter appetitum divisum in intellectivum atomum et sensitivum divisibilem requirantur intellectus vel panthasia et appetibile ad motum progressivum animalium. Et arguitur primo, quod non sit appetitus intellectivus indivisibilis \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut agat et non speculetur receptum, unde finaliter est ad opus. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 289\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Randnachtr\u228 \'e4ge aus thomistischen Schriften (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ex commentariis Thomistarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ); 267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (unterer Rand) Eintrag in Geheimschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Andree\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: GW 2348 (hier nur Abschrift der \u8222 \'84Quaestiones et dubia\ldblquote ; zum Kommentar vgl. 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; dort weitere Angaben). \endash  308\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

