\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thomas a Kempis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De imitatione Christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , lib. 1. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt ammoniciones ad spiritualem vitam utiles. De ymitacione Christi et contemptu omnium vanitatum mundi. >Capitulum primum.< Qui sequitur me, non ambulat in tenebris, dicit dominus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Io 8,12]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Hec sunt verba Christi \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quantum tibi ipsi vim intuleris. >Finitum et completum per me, fratrem Johannem Beckem, in profesto Luce Evangeliste \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (= 17. Okt.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , sub anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cccc lxvii, in Buscoducis.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: T. Lupo, De imitatione Christi libri quatuor, Citt\u224 \'e0 del Vaticano 1982 (Storia e Attualit\u224 \'e0, 6), S. 3\endash 86. Zu Verfasser und Werk vgl. K. Ruh, Geschichte der abendl\u228 \'e4ndischen Mystik, Bd. 4, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1999, S. 186\endash 194. Weitere Angaben vgl. in der Beschreibung zu Ms. B 120.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Merkverse. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sittenlehre f\u252 \'fcr M\u246 \'f6nche}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prior Clarevallensis cum multis fratribus venit ad beatum patrem Bernhardum circa obitum suum et interrogavit eum dicens: Que vite norma, qui mores, que sacra forma, quid deceat, quid non, instrue, sancte pater. Responsio sancti patris ad flentes filios: Que feci primo, vobis facienda reliquo: Nullum turbavi, discordes pacificavi. Lesus sustinui, nec michi complacui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Walther I Nr. 15053 und 14984; Walther II Nr. 39838b2; 2) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De duratione anni}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sex sunt ad puri. Bis sex sunt usque Philippi, ad Iacobi totidem, novem sunt ad Mychaelem. Sex ad Martini, sex ad natalia Christi, adde dies octo, totum replebitur anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Walther I Nr. 17612 (Druck: Hortulus animae, N\u252 \'fcrnberg: Koberger 1519, Bl. 17) und 17698. \endash  29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ephraem Syrus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De compunctione cordis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipiunt libri sex sancti Effrem Dyaconi< atque abbatis. Primus de compunctione cordis. Dolor me compellit dicere \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut omnis anima, que hec meditatur, trahatur ad vitam eternam. Amen. Explicit sextus liber et ultimus beati Effrem dyaconi atque abbatis de extremo Judicio et caritate et potencia lacrimarum. Unde tibi sit laus in evum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dulcedo, spes atque misericordia mea, Ihesu, domine crucifixe. >Per me, fratrem Johannem Beckem. Sub anno incarnacionis domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cccc lxvii, in Buscoducis, feria quinta quatuor temporumante natale \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (= 17. Dez.).< \endash  Druck: GW 9334. CPL Nr. 1143; CPG Nr. 3909, 3968 und 4125. Kristeller S. 522 (Hs. genannt). \endash  90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

