\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  oberer Rand: Besitzvermerk des 16./17. Jh.s: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Liber monasterii B. Marie Vallis s. Petri in Heisterbach. >Contiuncula in feriis nataliciis Jesu habita. 1545.< Quamquam de infantia dulcis Jesu, celeberrimi patres, commentari nonnihil meam elinguare infantiam \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 peccatores inquit salvos facere. >Peroratio.< Agite igitur, candidissimi patres fratresque, ad quod sumus peccatores nos esse agnoscamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 omnem spei anchora in ipso figamus \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 expectantes beatam spem et adventum domini, qui est benedictus in secula. Amen dixi \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs26 \u932 \'d4\u917 \'c5\u923 \'cb\u927 \'cf\u931 \'d3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  14 leer.}

