\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Stulti homines satis esse putant interfuisse misse, quam dicebant probari deo per se \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 nisi que per fidem et dilectionem fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

