\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De utilitate adventus Christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De utilitate adventus Christi.< Primo venit querere ovem perditam, Ezech 34: Ecce ego ipse requiram \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 [Ez 34,11] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 usque ad consummationem seculi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

