\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 449\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore et de sanctis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Pars hiemalis. (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominica prima adventus.< Cum appropinquaret \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [Mt 21,1]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominus noster Jesus Christus ergastulo nostre mortalitatis cinctus de loco ad locum non sine magno abiit labore \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominica secunda adventus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Erunt signa \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Lc 21,25]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sol: Christus, luna: ecclesia, virtutes celorum: ecclesie prelati, stelle: christiani \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominica tercia adventus.< Cum audisset \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Mt 11,2]. (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In eodem evangelia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ca. 4 legitur. Cum audisset Jesus, quod Johannes captus esset, secessit in Galileam \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominica passionis.< Quis ex vobis \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Io 8,46]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iudeorum oculi tenebrantur sua malitia ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ecati \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Feria quarta.< Facta sunt encenia \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Io 10,22]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Loquitur Christus verbo et non credunt \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Feria sexta.< Collegerunt summi pontifices \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Io 11,47\endash 48]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primo: Libido dominandi in pontificibus taxatur \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 quoniam ipsorum est regnum celorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Finis partis hiemalis. Incipit pars estivalis.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Nachtrag zum folgenden Predigttext. (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 449\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Pars aestivalis. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In die pasche.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abeuntes Maria Magdalena \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Mc 16,1]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum transisset sabbatum, quod venit in parascevem, in quo nihil operis facere licebat \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Alius sermo.< Nolite timere, Jesum queritis Nazarenum \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Mc 16,6]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Verbum est \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Text stellenweise unleserlich); (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Feria secunda.< Duo ex illis ibant \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Lc 24,13]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec historia dominico die resurrectionis sub vespera contigit \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Feria tercia.< Dum autem hec loquuntur \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Lc 24,36]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Turbatis discipu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 - (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 lis in morte Christi \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (437\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominica 23\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 trinitatis.< Abeuntes pharizei \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Mt 22,15]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quare in sermone, quia non poterant eum decipere in opere aut in actione \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (442\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominica 24 trinitatis.< Loquente Jesu ad turbas ecce princeps unus accessit \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Mt 9,18]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Duo exempla fidei habemus in hoc evangelio \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (447\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominica 25 trinitatis.< Cum videritis \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Mt 24,15]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vide, quid ante initium huius evangelii de templi exterminio dixerit \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 durum est tibi contra stimulum calcitrare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  449\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset161 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

