\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 450\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 458\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sermones de dedicatione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In die dedicationis templi. De epistola.< Ego Johannes vidi sanctam civitatem Jerusalem \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Apc 21,2]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hanc civitatem non templum manibus edificatum intelligit, sed civitatem celestem \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (453\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De evangelio.< Egressus Jesus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Lc 19,1]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Luna significat, que nisi a sole illuminetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 peccatores admittit, si resipuerint \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Text bricht ab). \endash  458\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

