\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 480\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 491\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Nachtr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Evangelium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 scilicet Liber generationis \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Mt 1,1]) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cum sit obscurum, brevibus explicari non potest. Continet enim in se multa et diversa nomina virorum ac mulierum veteris testamenti \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (486\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 virum suum mulier igitur significat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (486\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 487\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De virginitate virginis. Spiritus sanctus dixit per prophetam Isaiam septimo capitulo: Dominus ipse dabit vobis signum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 [Is 7,14]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Textus hebraicus habet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 halma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , quod sonat virginem, que est immaculata \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 qui tollit peccata mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (487\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 491\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Christus in predicationibus multum laborat, Luc 19. Quesivit, quod perierat per totam Judeam, tandem appropinquavit civitati Cesarea. Venit Jesus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Mt 16,13]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Philippus huic civitati nomen indidit Cesarea in honorem Cesaris \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et confortat absolutio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  491\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

