\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Schonhavia}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus de passione domini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit epistola de passione domini edita a magistro Iohanne Scoenhovie, suppriore in Gruenendael, canonico regulari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Religioso viro fratri N ordinis carthusiencium, nepoti meo karissimo, frater Iohannes, confrater et conservus in domino. Anguem eneum in cruce speculari \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ante exordium seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Lourdaux/Persoons, Catalogus, S. 147 und 150 (Hs. jeweils genannt); A. Gruijs / E. Persoons, Index des manuscrits contenant les \u339 \'9cuvres de Jean de Schoonhoven (1356\endash 1432), in: Scriptorium 20, 1966, S. 75\endash 82 (Hs. genannt S. 80). A. Gruijs, Jean de Schoonhoven (1356\endash 1432): De contemptu huius mundi, Bd. 2, Nijmegen 1967 (Hs. genannt S. 36 und 120). DSAM Bd. 8, Sp. 724\endash 735, bes. Sp. 727.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Schonhavia}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistula prima in Eemsteyn}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ex epistola magistri Johannis Scoenhovie, canonici regularis in Gruenendael.< Sicut immensa gloria fideliter deo in religione servientibus \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 bona mens semper gaudium habet. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Es folgen Texte aus anderen Quellen: (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Quoddam compendium utile religiosis proficere cupientis.< Volenti in bono proficere et quod inchoavit immobiliter et fixe perdurare, tria sunt necessaria \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 ut deum super omnia diligat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De tribus, que faciunt Christum in nobis commorari.< Precipue tria sunt, que faciunt Christum habitare in nobis, scilicet castitas, paupertas et humilitas \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 humilis ad merita, superbus ad vicia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De tribus importantibus pacem.< Item tria sunt, que maxime monachis pacem important \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Der letzte Text aus Johannes de Schonhavia: Epistula prima in Eemsteyn; Exzerpt bricht auf Bl. 134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ab; auf Bl. 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  folgt die Fortsetzung eines weiteren Textes: || \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cito bonum amittitur nisi a deo largitore custodiatur, ut dicit Gregorius \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Quare deus iustos flagellat.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Multis de causis deus iustos flagellat in hoc mundo \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 si de iusta passione murmuramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De tribus causis quare deus electos permittit temptari.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tribus quidem de causis dominus permittit electos suos in hac vita temptari \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 de propriis viribus succumbentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De certis impedimentis circa religiosis.< Sciendum quod impedimenta retrahencia nos a profectu et consecucionem virtutum et spiritualium bonorum sunt quatuor \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 invenire quod queris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De tribus dantibus diabolo occasionem temptandi.< Tria sunt vicia, que precipue tribuuntur hostibus nostris vires et fortitudinem nos temptandi \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 auxilium electis suis prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: V. Becker, Een brief van Johann van Schoonhoven, in: De Katholiek 86, 1884, S. 204\endash 210 und S. 352\endash 361; 87, 1885, S. 126\endash 141 (ohne Prolog; Text stellenweise stark gek\u252 \'fcrzt; der letzte Abschnitt fehlt). Lourdaux/Persoons, Catalogus, S. 144 (Hs. genannt); A. Gruijs / E. Persoons, Index \u8230 \'85 (s.o.). A. Gruijs, Jean de Schoonhoven (s.o.), Hs. genannt S. 34 und 120. DSAM Bd. 8, Sp. 724\endash 735, bes. Sp. 726. Zu den Zusatztexten vgl. A. Freckmann, Die Bibliothek des Klosters Bursfelde im Sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalter, G\u246 \'f6ttingen 2006, S. 44 f.}

