\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Petrus de Alliaco}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Speculum considerationis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus sequens, qui speculum consideracionis intitulatur, tres partes secundum tres consideraciones continet \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit prologus in speculum consideracionis editum a magistro Petro de Aliaco cardinali, episcopo Cameracensi, theologo famosissimo.< Quisquis es, qui a mundi sollicitudine elongasti fugiens et iuxta verbum prophete manens in solitudine \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 >Explicit prologus. Triplicem consideracionem proponitur capitulum primum.< In primis igitur considera te principaliter ad tria \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 vita reficiens unus deus benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Hain 849, 850. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 4855.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

