\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 David de Augusta}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De exterioris et interioris hominis compositione}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , lib. 1, pars 1 (\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 Formula novitiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit speculum monachorum.< Primo considerare debes, quare veneris, ad quid veneris. Propter quid enim venisti, nisi propter deum solum, ut fiet merces tua in vita eterna \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 castus sis in omnibus. Et quicumque hanc regulam secutus fuerit, pax Ihesu Christi in eo vivet. Amen. Explicit speculum monachorum editum a quodam devoto monacho ordinis minorum, qui et librum de profectibus religiosorum composuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Fr. David ab Augusta O.F.M., De exterioris et interioris hominis compositione ..., Quaracchi 1899, S. 3\endash 57 (Hs. genannt S. XXIII). Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 4155 mit Suppl.; Distelbrink Nr. 85 und 145; CALMA Bd. 3,1, S. 66 f., Nr. 1. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 2, Sp. 47\endash 58; anschlie\u223 \'dfend (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De religiosis proprietariis.< Peccatores pessimi pluribus de causis sunt proprietarii religiosi \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et si vis perfectus esse, vade et vende omnia, que habes et da pauperibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

