\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerlacus Petri}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Breviloquium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Breviloquium fratris Gerlaci pro danda occasione spiritualis exercitii cuidam bone voluntatis clerico.< In tumultibus et accidentiis exterioribus niti esse quietus \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 hunc prompte subicere et conformare. Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: CCCM 155, S. 240\endash 297 (Sigle du; Hs. genannt S. 38). Lourdaux/Persoons, Catalogus, S. 49 (Hs. genannt); M. M. Kors, De Middelnederlandse Brieven van Gerlach Peters (\u8224 \'86 1411). Studie en tekstuitgave, Nijmegen 1991 (Middeleeuwse Studies, 7), S. 20 und 41 (Kurzbeschreibung der Hs.). \endash  229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

