\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sermones de diversis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 41: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Bernardus de septem gradibus obediencie.< Non possumus \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [II Cor 3,5]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quid enim in hoc vase testeo \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et ad passionem voluntarius venit. >Hec Bernardus de obediencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: Leclercq/Rochais Bd. 6,1, S. 243\endash 254, hier S. 243\endash 252. (238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 12: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Bernardus in sermone quodam.< Recole, fili, primordia, attende media, memorare novissima \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et stridor dentium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: ebd. S. 127\endash 130 (Text gek\u252 \'fcrzt). (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 17 (Exzerpte): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Bernardus in quodam sermone de diversis.< Unde illi cura cordis \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 duas procedere constat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: ebd. S. 150\endash 156. (242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 27: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Bernardus in quodam sermone de diversis de graciarum actione.< Magna est super nos, dilectissimi, magna est valde misericordia dei nostri \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 qui est benedictus in secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: ebd. S. 198\endash 203 (Text gek\u252 \'fcrzt). CALMA Bd. 2,3, S. 308, Nr. 14.}

