\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Gouda}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Expositio mysteriorum missae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Excerpta ex Tractatu de expositione misse, edito a fratre Guilhelmo de Gouda ordinis minorum de observantia.< Ad noticiam eorum intellectualem, que in misterio misse aguntur, habendam sacerdotes, haud dubium existit, obligari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed divine tribue bonitati. >Explicit.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: GW 11874\endash 11897 (Incipit im Wortlaut identisch mit GW 11889). Franz, Messe, S. 601 f. Bl. 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zahlreiche Randnachtr\u228 \'e4ge.}

