\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guilelmus Durantis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rationale divinorum officiorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpte. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ex rationali divinorum ex libro 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , cap. 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . De aque benedicte aspersione.< Dum aqua benedicitur, sal admiscetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ex libro 6\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , cap. ut supra.< In benedictione baptismi sunt sex, quoniam sacerdos orat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 secuta est resurrectionis gloria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: CCCM 140, S. 265 f. und CCCM 140A; vgl. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

