\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Marchesinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Mammotrectus super Bibliam}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mammetractus super vocabula biblie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Vocabularius super legendas sanctorum. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Coram positus: tegenwordich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Supersticiosus, id est vanus vel superfluus ut supersticiosa religio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Nicolao\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Caterva, id est congregacio vel societas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vita celebs, id est vita casta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...; (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Ambrosicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pretorium, id est stede des gericht \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...; (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancta Lucia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Thoma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Sebastiano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancta Agneta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <; (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Vincencio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancta Agata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Mathia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Gregorio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De sancto Benedicto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De annunciacione Mariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Vokabelerkl\u228 \'e4rungen zum Actus apostolorum. (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Vokabelerkl\u228 \'e4rungen zu den Libri Samuhelis und Libri Regum. (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit prologus biblie.< Perferens, id est portans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Fides, id est certitudo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ) >Incipit primus liber biblie. Capitulum primum.< Abissus, id est profunditas aquarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Inanis et hoc est hic sine fructu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit secundus liber biblie.< Item. Exodus dicitur ab odos, quod est via et ex ebrayce dicitur hellesinos, latine vero exitus appelatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... Es folgen: (247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Levitici; (251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Numerorum; (252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Deuteronomii; (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Iosue; (254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Iudicum; (255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Ruth; (255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Paralipomenon; (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Ezrae; (259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Iob; (262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Tobiae; (263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Iudith; (264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Hester; (265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Proverbiorum; (267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Ecclesiastes; (268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Canticum Canticorum; (268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 270\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Sapientiae; (270\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Iesu filii Sirach; (273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Libri Macchabeorum; (276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Isaias propheta; (279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Hieremias propheta; (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber Baruch; (282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Hiezechiel propheta; (283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Danihel propheta. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic est finis, deo laus et gloria trinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Colophons Nr. 20827. \endash  Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 4776. Vokabelerkl\u228 \'e4rungen zum Teil volkssprachig (niederrheinisch).}

