\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Gerson}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De theologia mystica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Excerptum ex Tractatu Johannis de Gerson Cancellarii Parisiensis de mystica theologia speculativa. Qui tractatus dividitur in octo partes principales. Et quelibet pars subdividitur per considerationes. Sequitur prima consideratio prime partis de triplici theologia, scilicet propria, symbolica et mistica.< Aliqua est theologia mistica \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et stulta sapientia excedens laudantes. >Explicit.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 3, S. 250\endash 292, hier S. 252\endash 274 (Ausz\u252 \'fcge mit Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen).}

