\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Gerson}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De mystica theologia practica}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit prologus christianissimi doctoris Johannis de Gerson in tractatu de theologia mistica practice conscriptum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ab eodem sub xii considerationibus sive industriis.< Tractantes in lectionibus nostris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dilectus meus michi et ego illi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Ct 2,10]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 8, S. 18\endash 47 (mit Abweichungen). Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Exzerpt aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Antoninus Florentinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summa theologica}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dederat deus homini primo in sua creatione tria bona \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 gubernatorem mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Auf dem unteren Rand Exzerpt aus Johannes Gerson: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus de illuminatione cordis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

