\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Metaphysica. Translatio Nova}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ], \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 lib. 1\endash 12 (Translatio Guilelmi de Moerbeka); [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sententia libri Metaphysicorum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpte\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Omnes homines natura scire desiderant. Signum autem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Preter enim \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 agere debentes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 unus ergo princeps. Explicit liber duodecimus. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic ostendit, in quo omnia animalia convenient, scilicet quia omnia habent naturaliter sensum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et sic omnia sunt sine ordine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: Text: Aristoteles, Metaphysica. Recensio et translatio Guillelmi de Moerbeka. Ed. G. Vuillemin-Diem, Leiden u.a. 1995, S. 11\endash 269. Lacombe, AL, S. 65, Nr. 42; Kommentar: S. Thomae Aquinatis Opera omnia, hg. v. R. Busa, Bd. 4, Stuttgart 1980, S. 390\endash 507. (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Exzerpt aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Roberto Caraccioli}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Robertus de Litio): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sermo feriae sextae post dominicam secundam adventus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

