\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De bona fortuna}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , mit Kommentar. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Liber eiusdem de bona fortuna.< Habitum autem utique erit his dicere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quam vocamus kalokagachiam. >Explicit.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 a. Hic ostendit, quod natura non est bona fortuna; b. Hic ostendit, quod intellectus practicus seu ars non est bona fortuna; c. id est: cuilibet distribuit secundum quod meruit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 m. 1. bonum eventum, quia virtutes valent ad felicitatem, eciam bonus eventus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Lacombe, AL, S. 72, Nr. 50 und S. 160 f., Nr. 50. (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Eintrag in Geheimschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vel motionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

