\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-]Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De beatitudine}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit tractatus beati Thome de Aquino ordinis fratrum predicatorum De beatitudine eternitatis.< Beati qui habitant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Ps 83,5]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Domus dei est eterna beatitudo, quam naturaliter omnis homo desiderat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut manifestetur habundancia glorie tue per infinita secula seculorum. Amen. >Explicit Thomas de beatitudine.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Opera omnia, hg. v. R. Busa, Bd. 7, Stuttgart 1980, S. 709\endash 714. Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 14eb; Grabmann S. 398, Nr. 12; Dondaine/Shooner Nr. 698 (diese Hs.); Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 4453. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 1, Sp. 648\endash 650; van den Bosch, Observantie, S. 143, Anm. 87 (Hs. genannt). Werk \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 74, 218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

