\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-]Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De divinis moribus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tractatus beati Thome de divinis moribus. Capitulum primum.< Perfecti esto tote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] ... [Mt 5,48]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In hac sacra scriptura nihil nobis impossibile consulitur vel precipitur. In hoc verbo domini \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ipse solus scit numerum electorum. Benedictus deus. Amen. >Explicit tractatus beati Thome de divinis moribus. Per Suederum Isselborch.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Opera omnia, hg. v. R. Busa, Bd. 7, Stuttgart 1980, S. 706\endash 709. Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 14ey; Grabmann S. 398, Nr. 11; Dondaine/Shooner Nr. 698 (diese Hs.); Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 23681. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 2, Sp. 179 f.; van den Bosch, Observantie, S. 143, Anm. 85 (Hs. genannt). Werk \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 74, 251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (vgl. Kat. D\u252 \'fcsseldorf S. 250).}

