\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [Ps.-]Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De officio sacerdotis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Summula de officio sacerdoti et eciam de sacramentis ecclesie secundum Thomam.< Quia sacerdotis officium circa tria principaliter versantur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quales descripti sunt, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et regnat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per infinita secula seculorum Amen. >Explicit summa fratris Thome de Aquino. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \endash  Druck: Opera omnia, hg. v. R. Busa, Bd. 7, Stuttgart 1980, S. 714\endash 718. Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 14ec; Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 4719 mit Suppl.; Dondaine/Shooner Nr. 698 (diese Hs.); Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 27536.}

