\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Expositio super symbolum apostolorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit exposicio eiusdem super simbolum fidei.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Credo in unum deum.< Primum, quod est necessarium christiano cuilibet, est fides \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut semper memorie inprematur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!]. \endash  Druck: Opera omnia, hg. v. R. Busa, Bd. 6, Stuttgart 1980, S. 15\endash 22. Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 14da; Grabmann, S. 318, Nr. 5; Dondaine/Shooner Nr. 698 (diese Hs.); Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 9071. Van den Bosch, Observantie, S. 143, Anm. 88 (Hs. genannt). Es folgt Text des Symbolum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In summa sciendum est, quod secundum quosdam sunt duodecim articuli fidei, sex de divinitate secundum quod unus deus in essencia et ideo dicit: Credo in unum deum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 iudicare vivos set mortuos. >Explecit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 symbolum.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

