\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pius II. papa}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 :{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In libros Antonii Panormitae poetae de dictis et factis Alphonsi regis memorabilibus commentarius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Praefatio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Eneas episcopus Senensis Antonio Panormite, poete clarissimo, salutem plurimam dicit. Silvester Cremensis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 anthistes, cuius consilio in suam me curiam Fredericus imperator accersivit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 aliquid me videris esse commentum. Vale. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: De dictis et factis Alphonsi Regis Aragonum et Neapolis libri quatuor Antonii Panormitae cum respondentibus (...) ab Aenaea Silvio collectis. Ed. studio Davidis Chytraei, Wittenberg, 1585, S. 102\endash 155, hier S. 102.}

