\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Antonio Beccadelli}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De dictis et factis Alphonsi, regis Aragonum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , lib. 1, Prooemium. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Anthonius Panormitanus poeta Enee Silveo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 poete clarissimo salutem dicit plurimam et se reddit commendatum. Xenophon is, quem Greci non ab re musam acticam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vocant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 haut equidem facere erubescam, Ere sciere viros, martemque accendere cantu. Vale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: GW 3752; De dictis et factis Alphonsi Regis Aragonum et Neapolis libri quatuor Antonii Panormitae cum respondentibus (...) ab Aenaea Silvio collectis. Ed. studio Davidis Chytraei, Wittenberg 1585, S. 19 f. CALMA Bd. 1,3, S. 317, Nr. 3. \endash  136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 137 bis auf wenige Notizen auf Bl. 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

