\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Collecta de sancto Huberto}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Collecta de sancto Huperto episcopo.< Deus, qui teipsum in visione crucifixi beato Huperto, confessori tuo atque pontifici, ut sic eum ad fidem colligeres \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hec tue obtulimus maiestati. Per dominum nostrum Ihesum Christum filium tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

