\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Excerpta de focaristis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Geert Groote}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 xxiv articuli, de notoriis focaristis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ex dictis doctoris et magistri Gerardi Groet hoc scripsi et complevi.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In primis inter omnes ministros ecclesie malos maxime et in hiis cavendi sunt fornicatores notorii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 simul et racio firma. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: J. Clarisse, Over den geest en de denkwijze van Geert Groete (Groot, de Groot), kenbaar uit zijne schriften, in: Archief voor Kerkelijke Geschiedenis 8, 1837, S. 108\endash 117, hier S. 112\endash 114 (Text stellenweise abweichend); (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\endash vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Decretum Gratiani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , D. 32 c. 6 (Exzerpt) und D. 32 c. 6 Gr. p. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 32 distinccione in decretis Allexandri pape: Preter hoc precipiendo mandamus, ut nullus missam audiat presbiteri, quem scit concubinam indubitanter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 inducere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad penitenciam provocantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Friedberg Bd. 1, Sp. 118 f. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Super quo verbo dicit Bartolomeus Brixensis, glosator decretorum posterior Johanne \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut habetur ex cohabitacione clericorum et mulierum capitulo ultimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Decretum Gratiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt aus D. 81 c. 15. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item dis. 81. Gregorius omnibus per regnum Ytalicum et Teutonicorum: Si qui sunt presbiteri, dyaconi, subdyaconi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 obedire contempnit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Friedberg Bd. 1, Sp. 284 f. (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Geert Groote: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sermo de focaristis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpte. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota quod notorius fornicator per evidenciam facti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quesitum in eodem titulo.Item sciendum quod secundum beatum Thomam de Aquino peccat mortaliter, qui scienter notorii fornicatoris missam audierit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nisi in causa necessitatis, per Urbanum secundum in capitulo Verum, distincione 32\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: J. Clarisse, Over den geest (s.o.), in: Archief voor Kerkelijke Geschiedenis 2, 1830, S. 307\endash 395, hier S. 307 f. und 330 f. (Text gek\u252 \'fcrzt). Van Dijk, Prolegomena, S. 176 (Text identifiziert als \u8222 \'84XXIV Articuli, de notoriis focaristis\ldblquote , art. 11\endash 17); S. 451\endash 455 (Hs. genannt S. 453). Zum Verfasser vgl. K. Ruh, Geschichte der abendl\u228 \'e4ndischen Mystik, Bd. 4, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1999, S. 155\endash 164. \endash  31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

