\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber paenitentiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ]. Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Questiones ac casus varii circa penitenciam in iurisperitorum diversis summis dispersi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Penitencia multis modis a sanctis describitur. Ambrosius sic eam describit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 species pro specie ad terminum certum vel incertum. >Expliciunt quidem casus pro confessoribus circa penitenciam perutiles.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. \endash  Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 4576.}

