\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De paenitentia et confessione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Qualiter sacerdos debeat confortare penitentem.< Debet autem sacerdos circa penitenciam habere donum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Queritur utrum sacerdos mereatur audiendo confessionem.< Omissis disputacionibus firmissime tene et nullatenus dubites \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Quid facere debet sacerdos confitentibus sibi.< Debet autem sacerdos orare pro eis, qui sibi peccata confitentur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Utrum sacerdos debet aliud recipere a sibi confitente et utrum confitentes tenetur ei dare.< Dicturi sibi sacerdos debet aliud recipere a confitente sibi peccata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De confessione infirmorum et eorum penitencia.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sic tene, quod subtiliter et astute debes ab infirmis inquirere, qualiter se habuerunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Quid facit sacerdos postquam audiverit confessionem infirmi.< Postquam autem sciveris confessionem infirmi, non debes penitenciam iniungere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de hiis cum suis concordanciis. >Explicit<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

