\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De proprietatibus signorum zodiaci}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ries est primum signum zodioci \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 masculinum, calidum et siccum, igneum, colericum, orientale et habet ex parte hominis capud \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (...) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum luna fuerit in eo esse bonum est mutare de loco ad locum et omnia mobilia facere et nuncios mittere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in cuius membri signo luna est. Et hoc est de proprietatibus signorum zodiaci quo ad enfortimentum vel diffortimentum hominum. Et sic est finis\plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Thorndike/Kibre Sp. 130 ff. und 134; G. Rosi\u324 \'f1ska, Scientific writings and astronomical tables in Cracow. A census of manuscript sources (XIVth \endash  XVIth centuries), Wroc\u322 \'b3aw \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 u.a. 1984 (Studia Copernicana, 22), S. 51 f., Nr. 203\endash 207.}

