\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Franciscus Assisias}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Regula bullata}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , mit der Bulle \u8218 \'82Solet annuere\rquote  von Honorius III. (29.11.1223). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit regula et vita fratrum minorum edita a beato Francisco, confirmata a domino papa Honorio.< Honorius, episcopus, servus servorum dei, dilectis filiis, fratri Francisco et aliis fratribus de ordine fratrum minorum, salutem et apostolicam benedictionem. Solet annuere sedes apostolica \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que talis est: In nomine domini incipit vita fratrum. 1 capitulum. Regula et vita fratrum minorum hec est, scilicet domini nostri Jhesu Christi sanctum evangelium observare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod firmiter promisimus, observemus. Nulli ergo omnino hominum liceant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 se noverit incursurum. Datum Laterani tercio kalendas decembris, pontificatus nostri anno octavo. >Explicit vita et regula fratrum minorum.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: K. Esser, Die opuscula des hl. Franziskus von Assisi, 2. erweiterte und verbesserte Aufl., Grottaferrata (Romae) 1989, S. 366\endash 371. CALMA Bd. 3,4, S. 388, Nr. 19. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 171, 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

