\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gonsalvus Hispanus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Expositio super regulam Fratrum Minorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit quedam brevis expositio et perutilis regule fratrum minorum feliciter. Prologus.< Regula nostra, socie charissime, ne videatur tibi confusa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad penitendum in consciencia. Explicit quedam brevis et perutilis exposicio super regulam fratrum minorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Mohan S. 381; D\u237 \'edaz y D\u237 \'edaz Nr. 1724. Esser/Oliger, La tradition manuscrite (s.o.), S. 39, Anm. 95.}

