\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hugo de Balma}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Theologia mystica}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit libellus de triplici via, scilicet purgativa, illuminativa et unitiva.< Vie Syon lugent \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Lam 1,4]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Licet Jheremias propheta dixerit hoc verbum captivitatem populi sui deplorans \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sine aliqua cogitacione previa. Et sic est finis, de quo sit benedictus deus unus et trinus. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: SC 408 (Hs. genannt S. 114, Nr. 10 und S. 117) und SC 409. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 6458 mit Suppl. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 155, 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (dort weitere Angaben).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

