\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Adalgerus Episcopus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 (?): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Admonitio ad Nonswindam reclusam}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , recensio Albuini, Gruppe 1. (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Zweifaches Kapitelverzeichnis. (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\endash va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dedikationsbrief: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Albuinus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistula ad Heribertum Coloniensem archiepiscopum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber Albuini heremite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Domino Heriberto, Coloniensi archiepiscopo, Albuinus, heremita indignus, gloriam et pacem sempiternam. Ex quo, mi pater, misericordie vestre graciam promerui \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Scio vere nullum esse beatum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ubi multi sanctorum requiescunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 138, Sp. 185 f.; vgl. CCCM 45, S. 81. CALMA Bd. 1,2, S. 144, ALBU 1, Nr. 4. (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De caritate capitulum primum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum igitur de pluribus virtutibus te desiderem ammonere: in primis cupio, ut virtutem caritatis ante omnia studeas habere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nisi ille fecerit, a quo omne bonum procedit. Qui vivit et r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (egnat) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (ecula) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (eculorum)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: vgl. PL 134, Sp. 915\endash 938. CPL Nr. 1219 (Ps.-Isidorus Hispalensis); CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 911 (Ps.-Hieronymus), Nr. 3010a (Ps.-Ambrosius Mediolanensis), Nr. 3200 (Ps.-Caesarius Arelatensis), Nr. 3439 (Ps.-Isidorus Hispalensis); Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 1112, 5334, vgl. auch Nr. 6115, jeweils mit Suppl.; CALMA Bd. 1,1, S. 19, ADALGE 1. Zu Verfasserfrage, Textfassung und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Clavis des auteurs latins du Moyen \u194 \'c2ge, territoire fran\u231 \'e7ais 735\endash 987, Bd. 1: Abbon de Saint-Germain \endash  Ermold le Noir, Turnhout 1994 (CCCM. Clavis scriptorum latinorum medii aevi, auctores Galliae 735\endash 987; 1), S. 16\endash 21, hier S. 17 f.}

