\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De tribus Mariis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ex testimoniis quatuor ewangeliorum et epistola Augustini con\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 - (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tra Helvitium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sancta Maria, mater domini, et Maria, mater Jacobi Alphei et Ioseph, et mater filiorum Zebedei, scilicet Iacobi et Iohannis Ewangeliste, tres sorores fuerunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Maria, filia Ioachim, virgo permansit.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Unde versus: >Tres< tribus >Anna< viris >legitur< peperisse >Marias.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Walther I Nr. 19420.}

