\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Expositio missae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Missa a diversis diversimode exponitur, a sublimibus sublimiter, a simplicibus simpliciter exponi potest \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cum benedictione dicens: Venite benedicti etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Nota significationem allegoricam circa aliqua, que sunt in missa.< Intelligimus enim per altare crucem, per calicem sepulchrum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et pedes fuerunt sanguine rubricati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Hier nur ein Teil des Textes, der in Ms. B 120, 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Ms. B 129, 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 und Ms. B 205, 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  vollst\u228 \'e4ndig \u252 \'fcberliefert ist (vgl. Beschreibung zu Ms. B 120). \endash  75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

