\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-]Anselmus Cantuariensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dialogus Mariae virginis et Anselmi de passione domini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tract\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 atus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 > \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de passione Ihesu Christi et gloriosissime Marie virginis respondens dyalogus. Incipit feliciter. Tractatus.< Beatus Anselmus per singula quesivit passionem Ihesu Christi et beata Maria respondit per singula. Quesivit ergo sic primo Anelmus dicit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 : Domina carissima, quale fuit inicium passionis filii tui? \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et ei compaciebantur. Rogemus ergo dominum etc. Finis Dyalogi beati Anselmi de passione Ihesu Christi et beate Marie virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 159, Sp. 271\endash 290, hier Sp. 271\endash 288 (stellenweise abweichend und gek\u252 \'fcrzt). Perger Nr. 41.10; Cardelle de Hartmann S. 369\endash 377 (Hs. genannt); Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 4521.}

