\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Consuetudines Ordinis Praemonstratensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Dominica prima in adventu domini.< Dominica prima in adventu domini in utrisque vesperis et matutinis accenduntur septem lampades \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod si abbas non fuerit, prior per omnia adimplebit. Expliciunt consuetudines ordinis premonstratensis complete per manus fratris Henrici de Wylburg sacerdotis. Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 lxxxxvii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: P. F. Lef\u232 \'e8vre (Hg.), Coutumiers liturgiques de Pr\u233 \'e9montr\u233 \'e9 du XIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  et du XIV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  si\u232 \'e8cle, Louvain 1953 (Biblioth\u232 \'e8que de la revue d\rquote histoire eccl\u233 \'e9siastique, 27), S. 27\endash 93 (in dieser Hs. stellenweise mit Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen und Hufnagelnotation auf vier Linien).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Casus missae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Nota bene, o tu sacerdos.< Ut negligencias circa sacramentum altaris evenientibus in missa celebrantes sciant occurrere, debent hoc scriptum perlegere et lectum memoris commendare. Sacerdos si ante consecracionem corporis et sanguinis Christi morte vel gravi infirmitate occupetur, non oportet officium misse per alium suppleri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pretermissum est gracia brevitatis. Beda dicit: Sacerdos, qui est sine peccato mortali et in bono proposito, si non celebrat, cum habeat copiam celebrandi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 animas in purgatorio degentes patrocinia et bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 29299. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Nota.< Doctrina utilis et necessaria de hiis, que debent esse in sacerdote missam digne celebrante: Nam indigne accedens et celebrans reus erit corporis et sanguinis domini Ihesu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...}

