\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Compendium novorum sacerdotum super celebrationem missae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Nota.< O tu iuvenis sacerdos, nota bene notulam istam subscriptam. Sacerdotes de novo celebraturi multa indigent circumspectione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in fine dicetur: Eiusdem spiritus sancti deus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Text verglichen mit Ms. theol. lat. qu. 311, Staatsbibliothek zu Berlin \endash  Preu\u223 \'dfischer Kulturbesitz, Bl. 200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Expositio super \u8218 \'82Te igitur\rquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Supra loquitur, quod sacerdos invocat totam trinitatem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cum dicitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Te igitur\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 \rquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et fiunt tres cruces in memoria trinitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 totum sanguinem resumpsit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

