\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Excerpta et exemplum de arte moriendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Nider}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dispositorium moriendi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum circa propriam vitam multi sunt negligentes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 revelare dignatur humilibus et parvulis. Hec breviter collecta sunt ex nobilissimo libro eximii doctoris Iohannis Nider de arte moriendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Hain 8589 (anonym), 11828 f.; Copinger 4420, 4424. Kaeppeli Nr. 2536. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 1064 mit Suppl.; Hamesse/Syzller Nr. 9363. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 6, Sp. 971\endash 977; R. Rudolf, Ars moriendi, s.o., S. 83 f. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Jacobus de Paradiso}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De arte bene moriendi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota eciam, quod venerabilis pater Jacobus Carthusiensis in tractatu suo de arte moriendi dicit, quod si per angelos malos inmissa fuerit quedam dubitacio fidei aut diffidencia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 potest donari intime affectandi. Hec ille\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Hain 9339 f. D. Mertens, Iacobus Carthusiensis, s.u., S. 187\endash 203; R. Rudolf, Ars moriendi, s.o., S. 100 f.; VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 4, Sp. 478\endash 487. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Exemplum de arte bene moriendi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sciendum eciam, quod si volumus bene mori, tunc antea debemus discere bene mori. Quid autem sit scire bene mori, patet per tale exemplum. Quidam mercator transiens per silvam invenit ibi heremitam centenarium degentem, a quo quesivit, quod ibi faceret. Cui heremita: Disco mori \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et factus est devotus homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Auslegung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Debet ergo ab hoc seculo migrans animam suam deo comittens feliciter et voluntarie, quando et quomodo benignissimus pater voluerit, sicut supra patuit, sue voluntati obediens expirare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et de tribus mortuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . In der Auslegung genannt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Johannes abbas montis Synai \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Climacus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). \endash  Vgl. Rudolf, Ars moriendi, s.o., S. 23.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-Augustinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Speculum peccatoris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit speculum peccatoris.< Quoniam, karissime, in via huius vite fugientis sumus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut per hec eternam dampnationem evadas et cum domino Ihesu Christo vitam eternam possideas. Quod tibi concedat ille, qui est in secula deus benedictus. Amen. >Et sic est finis, sit laus et gloria trinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< Colophons Nr. 20858. \endash  Druck: PL 40, Sp. 983\endash 992. Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 1481; Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 4918 mit Suppl.; CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 3076. R. Rudolf, Ars moriendi, s.o., S. 14. Weitere Angaben in der Beschreibung zu Ms. B 108, 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

