\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gallus de Aula Regia}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Malogranatum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpte. (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Lib. 3, dist. 1, cap. 23 und dist. 3, cap. 9. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sciendum quod septem ecclesie sacramenta remedia sunt, per que homo quodammodo in spiritualem creaturam regeneratur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod nobis prestare dignetur ipse auctor et dator glorie Ihesus Christus dominus noster in secula seculorum benedictus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Lib. 3, dist. 1, cap. 23 und dist. 3, cap. 9. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De dignitate et statu sacerdotali.< Considerate, o sacerdotes, inenarrabilem vestre excellencie dignitatem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ipso largiente, qui est super omnia deus benedictus in secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Lib. 3, dist. 1, cap. 23 und dist. 3, cap. 9. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De vita contemplativa.< Contemplacio secundum beatum Augustinum est mentis suspense in deum quedam elevacio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut videns non videat, audiens non intelligat. Hec ex malogranato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Hain 7449\endash 7451. Weitere Angaben in den Beschreibungen zu Ms. B 101a und Ms. B 101b.}

