\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Henricus Herpius}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De processu humani profectus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ], sermones 4, 6, 8. (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 4. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit sermo notabilis de duplici iugo Christi, scilicet humanitatis et divinitatis, et quomodo utrumque assumendum est.< Tollite iugum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Mt 11,29]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum rerum omnium opifex in omnibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sua claritate perlustrare debet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: G. Epiney-Burgard, Henri Herp: De processu humani profectus. Sermones de diversis materiis vitae contemplativae, Wiesbaden 1982 (Ver\u246 \'f6ffentlichungen des Instituts f\u252 \'fcr Europ\u228 \'e4ische Geschichte Mainz, 106: Abteilung f\u252 \'fcr Abendl\u228 \'e4ndische Religionsgeschichte), S. 118\endash 126. (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 6. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De tribus, que ducunt ingratum ad detestabilem recidivacionem.< Salva animam tuam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Gn 19,17]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec sunt verba consiliantis angeli \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sicut odium est vicium extreme dampnabilitatis. A quo nos custodiat Ihesus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: ebd., S. 135\endash 145. (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 8. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De graciarum actione deo reddenda et gratitudine.< Cum graciarum actione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Phil 4,6]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ut ergo ad summum benefactorem efficacius convertamur per graciarum actionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et nichil homini attribuere. Ad laudem domini Ihesu. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: ebd., S. 156\endash 163, hier S. 157 (Z. 44)\endash 163. Zum Verfasser vgl. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Bd. 3, Sp. 1127\endash 1135; K. Ruh, Geschichte der abendl\u228 \'e4ndischen Mystik, Bd. 4, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1999, S. 219\endash 228.}

