\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sermones de diversis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , sermo 27. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sermo beati Bernardi contra pessimum vicium ingratitudinis.< Magna est super nos, dilectissimi, magna valde misericordia dei nostri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia graciarum actionem magis quam dictionem a nobis exigit dator graciarum, dominus deus noster, qui est benedictus in secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: Leclercq/Rochais Bd. 6,1, S. 198\endash 203. CALMA Bd. 2,3, S. 308, Nr. 14.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-]Augustinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sermones ad fratres in eremo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 3. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sermo beati Augustini de custodia lingue et silencio.< Silencium, fratres mei karissimi, inter cetera nobis summe in heremo necessarium est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 toto corpore volantes in celum. Ad quod perducat nos Christus dominus noster. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 40, Sp. 1239\endash 1240. CPPM Bd. 1, Nr. 1130. (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 17. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sermo eiusdem de ociositate vitanda.< Apostolus Petrus, fratres dilectissimi, de nostra salute sollicitus, nos dulciter ammonet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quorum habitacio iam ibi est. Quam nos obtinere faciat ille, qui est benedictus in secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 40, 1262\endash 1264. CPPM Bd. 1, Nr. 1144. (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 8. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sermo eiusdem ad fratres suos de commendacione perseverancie.< Fratres mei, sicut ait apostolus: Non potest coronari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [II Tim 2,5]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nullus igitur legittime certat, nisi qui in campo usque ad finem certat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui bene faciendo perseverat usque ad finem. Quod donum prestet nobis ille, qui pro nobis mori dignatus est. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 40, Sp. 1249\endash 1250. CPPM Bd. 1, Nr. 1135. Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung der \u8222 \'84Sermones ad fratres in eremo\ldblquote  vgl. Kurz, Augustinus, 5,1, S. 415\endash 422.}

