\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-]Augustinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistula ad sororem de obitu sanctae Monicae}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sermo de sancta Monica, matre sancti Augustini.< Monica, mater sancti Augustini, cuius historia trahitur ex summa sancti Augustini, ex nono confessionum et ex duabus epistolis, quas sanctus Augustinus scripsit sue sorori, Perpetue virgini. Hortor te, inquit Augustinus, dilecta sponsa Christi, ut deo studeas in omnibus placere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sepultum fuerit, in novissimo die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: AASS, Mai, Bd. 1, S. 485\endash 486. CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 146 (2); BHL Nr. 5999. Vgl. CPL 367. Kurz, Augustinus, 5,1, S. 260.}

