\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ps.-]Caesarius Arelatensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Homiliae ad monachos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sermo beati Cesarii episcopi de bello hominis contra vicia et de exemplo bone vite et inpugnacione dyaboli.< Ad hunc monasterii locum, karissimi, non ad quietem, non ad securitatem, sed ad pungnam certamenque convenimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in filiis meritus iam resurgat. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: CC 101B, S. 861\endash 868 (PL 67, Sp. 1059\endash 1062). CPPM Bd. 1, Nr. 4380. (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sermo eiusdem de continencia a viciis.< Videte vocacionem vestram, fratres karissimi; venire quidem ad heremum summa perfeccio dicitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et in future presidium. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: CC 101A, S. 521\endash 530, hier S. 522\endash 529 (PL 67, Sp. 1067\endash 1069). CPPM Bd. 1, Nr. 4383.}

