\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thomas a Kempis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sermones ad novitios}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De concordia fratrum et melodia divinae laudis.< Ecce quam bonum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Ps 131,1]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 David sanctus et vere propheta magnus coram domino \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et dissolutione semper retinere. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Opera omnia, Bd. 6, Freiburg 1905, S. 7\endash 13. (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 4. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De bonis colloquiis invicem habendis.< Ubi sunt duo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Mt 18,20]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Attendite, dilecti fratres, presenciam Christi in omni loco \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 non mea voluntas, sed tua semper fiat. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: ebd., S. 32\endash 36.}

