\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardus de Zutphania}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De spiritualibus ascensionibus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , cap. 43\endash 46. (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Cap. 43. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\scaps\lang1033\fs26 D\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 e tribus, quibus sustentatur et promovetur spiritualis ascensio, scilicet leccione, meditacione et oracione.< Quia non est humane fragilitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 puritati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cordis semper insistere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et discrete assumantur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Cap. 44. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Qualiter sacra lectio adiuvat et sustentat ascendentes et qualiter lectio sit ad spiritualem profectum ordinanda et dirigenda.< Igitur timore percussus et compunctione depressus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et de affectu surgas ad oracionem. Hec de lectione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Cap. 45. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De meditacione.< Meditacio vero dicitur, qua ea, que legisti vel audisti, studiosa ruminacione in \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 corde tuo pertractas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 turbulentis implicacionibus perturbent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Cap. 46. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De oracione et modo orandi.< Oracionem vero, quocumque pergis, ubicumque fueris in domo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vel tui examinacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: F. J. Legrand (Hg.), G\u233 \'e9rard Zerbolt de Zutphen: La mont\u233 \'e9e du c\u339 \'9cur (De spiritualibus ascensionibus), Turnhout 2006 (Sous la r\u232 \'e8gle de Saint Augustin, 11), S. 274\endash 297. Weitere Angaben in der Beschreibung zu Ms. B 129, 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und Ms. B 156, 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

