\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 David de Augusta}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De exterioris et interioris hominis compositione}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpte. (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Lib. 2 [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 De profectibus religiosorum]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , cap. 1. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De quatuor necessariis volentibus proficere.< Quatuor sunt, in quibus novi et incipientes cauti debent esse, si volunt proficere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et ita intrare in gloriam suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Fr. David ab Augusta O.F.M., De exterioris et interioris hominis compositione, Quaracchi 1899, S. 66\endash 71 (letzte Passage gek\u252 \'fcrzt). CALMA Bd. 3,1, S. 66 f., Nr. 1. Distelbrink Nr. 100. (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Lib. 1, pars 1 [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Formula novitiorum]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , cap. 20. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De exemplo domini nostri Ihesu Christi ante oculos habendo.< In omnibus virtutibus et bonis moribus prepone tibi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia in omnibus semper optimus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: ebd., S. 25\endash 27. Distelbrink Nr. 145.}

