\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Antoninus Florentinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summa theologica}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , pars 3, cap. 10 (De statu religiosorum). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De pertinentibus ad commendationem vere religionis.<De hiis, que pertinent ad commendationem religionis, que predicabilia sunt laicis et religiosis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et regularem disciplinam de conse. dis. v Numquam. >Hec ex \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 quarta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 parte summe Anthonini tercia, titulo xvi \u8218 \'82De statu religiosorum\rquote , capitulo decimo \u8218 \'82De pertinentibus ad commendationem vere religionis\rquote .< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: GW 2185\endash 2198a. Kaeppeli Nr. 239; CALMA Bd. 3,1, S. 300.}

