\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Collecta ascetica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De religiosis et monachis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Cur religiosi paciuntur tepiditatem.< Scire debes, quod tepiditas seu desidia mentis sive corporis solet evenire tripliciter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 uterque dyabolum portat in lingua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De cognitione sui ipsius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >De suiipsius discussione dicit beatus Bernardus:< Integritatis tue sis curiosus explorator \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in suiipsius cognicione et noticia erit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De lectoribus et expositione sacrae scripturae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Que et quot in se debet habere lector sacre scripture. Lector sacre scripture seu theologie septem in se debet habere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Unde de hoc habentur metra: Littera gesta docet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Walther II Nr. 13999. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De sacramento eucharistiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota: Sacramentum eucaristie in penitentibus seu incipientibus est culpe expiativum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ipsorum refectivum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Genannte Autoren und Quellen: Biblia, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Basilius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bernardus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gregorius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Verba seniorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hugo de Sancto Victore }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Didascalicon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ).}

