\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Ps.-]Augustinus: De vita christiana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si christianum te esse delectat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et imitatur exemplum. >Hec beatissimus pater noster Augustinus in libro de vita christiana.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: PL 40, Sp. 1031\endash 1046. CPL Nr. 730. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [Thomas a Kempis: Epistula ad quendam a ministerio suo absolutum de recommendatione solitudinis et custodia silentii]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Dyabolus nititur impedire devotionem hominis ad deum.< Omnium bonorum emulator diabolus considerans hominis cum deo pactionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 viciorum victor et expulsor erit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Opera omnia, Bd. 4, Freiburg 1918, S. 401\endash 445, hier S. 442 f.}

