\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Gerson: Epistula contra professum inoboedientem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur epistola notabilis doctoris eximii Johannis Gerson contra professum quendam inobedientem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De ore tuo te iudico \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Lc 19,22]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si hoc dixit in parabola dominus de servo non multiplicante \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 aut aliter sapiens quam oportet. >Johannes, cancellarius Parisiensis, Lugduni, anno domini M cccc xxvi, in ianuario.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 2, S. 282\endash 284.}

