\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Thomas a Kempis]: Epistulae.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ><Epistola incitativa> ad spiritualem prof<ectum>.<K<arissime frater, libenter tecum divido, si qu>id boni dominus pauperi serv<o> suggesserit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vincenti dabo manna absconditum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Apc 11,17]. (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Epistola pro confortatione cuiusdam temptati.< Suscipiamus, karissime, de manu dei, quitquit voluerit super nos venire deus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per ipsum convalescamus in ipso. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Epistola de conversione et perseverancia in bono proposito.< Dilecte frater, intime congaudeo tibi, quia invenisti locum deo serviendi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que nobis pariter concedat vitam eternam. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Opera omnia, Bd. 4, Freiburg 1918, S. 449\endash 461 und 466\endash 479. U. Bodemann-Kornhaas, Die Kleineren Werke ... (vgl. Bl. 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 137 (Hs. genannt).}

