\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Petrus Blesensis: Epistula ad Alexandrum de sancto Albano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Epistola Petri Blesensis invitatur novicius ad fervorem religionis.< Dilecto et predilecto socio et amico magistro Alexandro de sancto Albano, P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (etrus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Blesen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (sis) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 archidiaconus, salutem et de mundo triumphum. Totis medullis anime conversioni et conversationi vestre congratulor \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 donec eam miseratio tua continuet ad profectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 207, Sp. 404\endash 408. Sharpe Nr. 1171, hier S. 420.}

