\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [Thomas a Kempis]: Libellus de disciplina claustralium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipiunt ammoniciones ad spiritualem vitam utiles, in quibus consistit disciplina claustralis. Capitulum 1.< Apprehendite disciplinam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Ps 2,12]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Disciplina claustralis si strenue servetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ubi Christus est in gloria patris per eterna secula regnans. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit libellus devotus de ammonicionibus ad vitam spiritualem utilibus scriptus anno domini 1479\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \endash  Druck: Opera omnia, Bd. 2, Freiburg 1904, S. 265\endash 319. U. Bodemann-Kornhaas, Die Kleineren Werke ... (vgl. Bl. 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 140 (Hs. genannt).}

