\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [Ps.-]Johannes [Chrysostomus]: Homilia 27\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ex quodam sermone beati Johannis episcopi de confessione peccati.< Confitemini domino \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Ps 105,1]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Spiritus sanctus medelam purgandi facinoris obtulit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod delictorum sordidarat macula. >Hec beatus Johannes episcopus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \endash  Druck: PLS 4, Sp. 736 f. CPL Nr. 926.}

