\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Leo Papa: Sermones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 43. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sermo beati Leonis pape de xl\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .< Apostolica, dilectissimi, doctrina nos ammonet, ut deponentes veterem hominem cum actibus suis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 magnificent patrem vestrum, qui est in celis. Per Christum dominum nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: CC 138A, S. 251\endash 257. (254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 35, Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Item ex sermone eiusdem de epiphania domini.< Considerantes, dilectissimi, ineffabilem divinorum munerum largitatem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cui est honor et gloria in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: CC 138, S. 188\endash 194, hier S. 191\endash 194. CPL Nr. 1657.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [Johannes Cassianus]: De institutis coenobiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , lib. 4, cap. 33\endash 41. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ex institutis patrum libro quarto.< Sicut immensa gloria fideliter servientibus domino ac secundum institucionis eius regulam ei coherentibus repromittuntur in futurum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nullis factionibus devolveris. >Hec ex patrum institutis libro 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: SC 109, S. 170\endash 184 (vom Kapitel 34 nur ein Exzerpt). CPL Nr. 513. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Notiz bez\u252 \'fcglich des folgenden Werkes: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Ex vita philosophorum.< Xistus Pytagoricus, philosophus, qui claruit tempore Octaviani, scripsit librum sententiarum moralium notabilium, quem Encheridion appellavit, quem Rufinus presbyter claro sermone apertoque ad preces cuiusdam de greco in latinum transtulit, de quo libro beatus Augustinus mentionem facit in libro retractationum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Gualteri Burlaei liber de vita et moribus philosophorum, hg. v. H. Knust, T\u252 \'fcbingen 1886 (Bibliothek des Litterarischen Vereins in Stuttgart, 177), S. 350 und 352. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Bemerkung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si autem Xistus sit Sixtus papa, cui sequens libellus attribuitur, satis dubito incertumque habeo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

