\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [Ps.-]\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Sextus Pythagoreus: Sententiae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , versio latina auctore Rufino. (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Rufinus Aquileiensis: Praefatio in Sexti Sententias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit prefacio Rufini presbiteri in Encheridion beati Sixti pape.< Scio quia, sicut grex ad vocem proprii pastoris libenter accurrit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vel latine anulus appelletur. Explicit prefacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: CC 20, S. 259 (nach der Edition von H. Chadwick, s.u.). CPL Nr. 198h. Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit encheridion beati Sixti pape et martiris.< Fidelis homo electus homo est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nil audeas dicere de deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: H. Chadwick, The Sentences of Sextus. A contribution to the history of early Christian ethics, Cambridge 1959 (Text and studies, N.S., 5), S. 9\endash 63. CPPM Bd. 2, Nr. 3537; CPG Nr. 1115. Hinweise zur \u228 \'e4lteren Literatur vgl. bei G. Meyer / M. Burckhardt, Die mittelalterlichen Handschriften der Universit\u228 \'e4tsbibliothek Basel, Abteilung B: Theologische Pergamenthandschriften, Bd. 2, Basel 1966, S. 777 f.}

