\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [Ps.-]Hieronymus: Ad Oceanum de opprobriis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Jheronimus ad Occeanum de perpessione tribulacionum.< Diversorum obprobria, tribulaciones multiplices \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et nunc et semper in omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: PL 30, Sp. 282\endash 288. CPL Nr. 744.}

