\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Vorderspiegel: Vermerk des Kompilators: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Notum sit omnibus hunc librum lecturis: Quomodo sepe inibi allegatur \u8218 \'82unde infra in summa\rquote , que tamen in hoc eodem volumine non est compacta, hec querantur in summa baptistiniana. Nam ob spissitudinem huius codicis non potuerunt insimul compingi veluti proposueram \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (vgl. Bl. 436\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ).}

