\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Besitzvermerk aus dem Jahr 1510: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Liber fratrum cruciferorum in Duseldorp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < und Inhaltsverzeichnis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Anno quingentesimo decimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Trithemius: De\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 scriptoribus ecclesiasticis\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Exzerpt bez\u252 \'fcglich Eusebius Caesariensis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abbas Tritemius de Scriptoribus. Eusebius Cesariensis, Palestine ecclesie episcopus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Claruit sub Constantino magno, cui amicissimus fuit propter eximiam doctrinam et vite sanctitatem. Anno 320. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Johannes Trithemius, De scriptoribus ecclesiasticis, Paris 1512, fol. XV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

