\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Trithemius: De scriptoribus ecclesiasticis, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Exzerpt bez\u252 \'fcglich Bernardus de Parentis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Abbas Tritthemius de Scriptoribus. Bernardus Parentinus ordinis fratrum predicatorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Claruit sub Ludvico imperatore. Anno domini M ccc. xl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Johannes Trithemius, De scriptoribus ecclesiasticis, Paris 1512, fol. CXXX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

