\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Bernardus de Parentis: Tractatus de officio missae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Elucidarius omnium difficultatum circa officium misse concurrencium fratris Ber. de Parentis ordinis predicatorum provincie Tholosane, conventus Orthesii in Vasconia, qui in hoc opere sequitur illustrissimi ac eximii doctoris sancti Thome determinaciones et dicta quo ad conclusiones, qui aliter lilium misse nuncupatur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\endash va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dedikationsbrief: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit epistola.< Reverendissimo in Christo patri ac suo pre ceteris domino speciali domino P., divina providencia episcopo Albiensi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit prologus.< Quoniam clamitat sapiens: Perscrutator maiestatis opprimetur a \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 gloria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Prv 25,27], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 idcirco nullus existimet hoc officium sufficienter expositum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\endash vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Collatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit collacio.< Domine, non sum dignus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad reliquias preciosas non debet homo accedere nisi cum reverencia et timore \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit tractatus.< Tractandum est nunc in hoc tractatu, quomodo quis digne et reverenter ad hoc sacramentum accedere debeat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui hunc doctorem sequitur, non ambulat in tenebris, sed habebit lumen vite, quod nobis concedat dominus Ihesus Christus. >Per manus humilis fratris Henrici de Werdenborch, alias de Broichusen, ad honorem dei et domini nostri Ihesu Christi, anno domini M cccc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (recte: ccccc)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 x\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , in crastino sanctorum apostolorum Symonis et Iude \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (= 29. Okt.).< \endash  Druck: Hain 12416\endash 20. Kaeppeli Nr. 643 (mit Nennung dieser Hs. auf S. 231); Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 28128, 29149; CALMA Bd. 2,3, S. 350, Nr. 2. Franz, Messe, S. 502\endash 506; P. van den Bosch, in: Clairlieu 36, 1978, S. 171 (Hs. genannt; Text mit dem \u8222 \'84Elucidarius\ldblquote  von Honorius Augustodunensis verwechselt). \endash  258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

