\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Liber de statu mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit liber de statu mundi.< Est stupor ante mori quam vivere mirabilis res est et communis cogimur unde fari. >Est stupor.< Convenerunt duo philosophi et super statu huius nequam mundi habitis inter se diversis colloquiis pre stupore et horribilitate percussi deplorantes eundem sic exorsi sunt: >Est stupor ante mori quam vivere.< Quia non est vivere nisi virtuose vivere. Concordat ad hoc dictum Senece ad Lucillum: Plures moriuntur antequam incipiunt vivere. Et quia hoc terribile, prochdolor, et commune nimis est temporibus istis. Igitur hoc opusculum ad tuicionem et premunicionem bonorum, detestacionem et correpcionem malorum conscripserunt. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Es folgt Inhaltsangabe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et primo modicum de huius nequam mundi statu, >ubi dicit: Mundus prostibulum.< 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  de cuiusdam monstri horribilitate perverse congregacioni comparati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 16\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  exhortacio ex precedentibus exemplificacionibus sumpta pro fidelium emendacione et melioracione. 17\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et ultimo de inhabitancium dictum paradisum felicitate. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deploracio duorum philosophorum de perversitate status nequam mundi. Mundus prostibulum est, nam nulla fides nisi pro se quilibet aspirat decipiens alium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 angariatur inops. Per hoc monstrum et figuram eius intelligere potes condicionem et deformitatem congregacionis perverse sive in patria, civitate; de villa seu qualibet alia congregacione ecclesiastica vel seculari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Utinam totum bene succedat, vulgariter autem: Alles musez wail ergeyn. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Gallice: Toute schose puist bien alleit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Numquam bene succedat, vulgariter autem: Nummer kums zo gute. Gallice: Jamais bien n\rquote aveingne \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Versus: Nulli compatitur lectator adeptus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... Walther II Nr. 12377 ... (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Repertum est, quod tales plerumque cicius audirent socialia quam nimis seriosa. Versus: Vir videas, quod tu iubeas, dum magnus haberis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... Walther I Nr. 20431 ... (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Judicii signum tellus sudore madescit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... Exzerpt aus Sibylla Tiburtina, vgl. Schaller/K\u246 \'f6nsgen Nr. 8495 mit Suppl.; (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quamvis peccator tibi dixerit hoc modulamen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... Walther I Nr. 15198; (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Minimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fit iudex, fraus est mercator in urbe \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... Walther I Nr. 11065; (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Exortacio ex precedentibus exemplificacionibus sumpta pro fidelium emendacione et melioracione. Hii licet ante fidem cum exemplo crucifixi se sua parvificant, ut populum redimant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De inhabitancium dictum paradison felicitate. Hic populus felix, qui tali iudice gaudet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 laudem promererent minus debite satis esset etc. Nota metra sequentes: Effluo, transcendo, quo, quis privatur, habundo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... Ab Bl. 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Exzerpte aus Robertus Holcot: Moralitates (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ymago oracionis, figura peccati mortalis, ymago luxurie, ymago penitencie, pictura amoris, historia pietatis et clemencie, pictura superbie, pictura fortune, pictura humilitatis, pictura trium condicionum per tria poma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). Verglichen mit Ms. theol. lat. qu. 249, Staatsbibliothek zu Berlin \endash  Preu\u223 \'dfischer Kulturbesitz, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Sharpe Nr. 1475, hier S. 555. (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Moralizaciones aliarum predictarum picturarum invenies per fratrum Robertum Holcot ordinis fratrum predicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Bilder nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt. Unbeschrieben: 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

