\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [Dionysius Cartusianus: Epistu\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 la de cursu puerorum ad sanctum Michaelem]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Anno milleno quater c l simul octo / Lumina cum velis pueri sancti Michaelis / Per mare sic visitant nescitur quomodo pergant / Nil eis constat eos dicta questio pulsat / Que sint hac in re dominus novit omnia certe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 esuper illustrari, reverende domine, doctor atque in Christo predilecte preceptor, petistis, ut dominationi vestre ac studiositati insinuem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et valeat semper in Christo pietas vestra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms XIII 857, Nieders\u228 \'e4chsische Landesbibliothek Hannover, 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , vgl. H. H\u228 \'e4rtel (Hg.), Handschriften der Nieders\u228 \'e4chsischen Landesbibliothek Hannover, Teil 2: Ms I 176a \endash Ms Noviss. 64, Wiesbaden 1982, S. 200 f. Dionysii Cartusiensis Opera selecta, Bd. 1: K. Emery, Prolegomena: Bibliotheca manuscripta; IA: Studia bibliographica, Turnhout 1991 (= CCCM 121), S. 121 und 251, Nr. 155; CALMA Bd. 3,1, S. 93, Nr. 77. \endash  59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

