\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Matthias de\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Liegnitz: Postilla super epistu\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 las dominicales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Videte quoniam non michi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Sir 24,47]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hanc proposicionem scribit sapiens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et gloriosissime virginis Marie eiusdem dei genitricis. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Sequitur epistola prime dominice adventus.< Scientes, quia hora est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Rm 13,11\endash 14]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic commendat caritatem eo, quod per ipsam est oportunitas bene operandi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad se trahit ad finem permansurum, quod nobis concedat, qui sine fine vivit et regnat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Fratres, quecumque enim scripta sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Rm 15,4\endash 13]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic ostendit, quod autoritas pertinet ad instruccionem eorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 virtutem tocius bonitatis adipisci mereamini, quod concedat nobis Ihesus Christus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sic nos existimet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [I Cor 4,1\endash 5]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quando aliquis dominus venturus in proximo expectatur, consueverunt ministri, id est minores officiales, domum mundare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et exclusi felices regnabunt cum domino in eternum. Quod nobis concedat Ihesus Christus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (...) (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Epistola dominice 23\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .< Fratres, imitatores mei estote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Phil 3,17\endash 21]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Virtuosi et caritativi hominis est exhortari ad virtutes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et dominum deum in nobis habitare facimus. Hoc ipse concedat, qui sine fine vivit et regnat etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Epistola dominice 24\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .< Itaque, fratres mei karissimi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Phil 4,1\endash 3]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Itaque, fratres mei karissimi, o Paule, Paule, ex habundancia cordis os loquitur, quod plenum est fraterna caritate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed quod vitam eternam acquirat, quam nobis concedat Ihesus Christus, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Epistola dominice ultime post festum trinitatis.< Fratres, non cessamus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Phil 1,9\endash 14]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De quanto enim aliquis actus est nobilior et excellencior \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia affuit principio misericorditer medio et fini in secula seculorum. Amen. >Explicit postilla epistolarum dominicalium per circulum anni compilata per magistrum Mathiam de Beghenitz \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , sacre theologie professorem.< \plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 \endash  Initien aller 58 Texte in Schneyer II (in dieser Hs. fehlt Text Nr. 7, in nativitate domini). Zu Verfasser und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. J. T\u345 \'f8i\u353 \'9aka, Liter\u225 \'e1rn\u237 \'ed \u269 \'e8innost p\u345 \'f8edhusitsk\u233 \'e9 university, Praha 1967 (Sb\u237 \'edrka pramen\u367 \'f9 a p\u345 \'f8\u237 \'edru\u269 \'e8ek k d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u277 e\plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 jin\u225 \'e1m University Karlovy, 5), S. 122 f. (Hs. genannt S. 122); ders., \u381 \'8eivotopisn\u253 \'fd slovn\u237 \'edk p\u345 \'f8edhusitsk\u233 \'e9 pra\u382 \'9esk\u233 \'e9 univerzity 1348\endash 1409 / Repertorium biographicum Universitatis Pragensis praehussiticae 1348\endash 1409, Praha 1981 (Kni\u382 \'9enice Arch\u237 \'edvu Univerzity Karlovy, 12), S. 364. Weitere Hss. in: ders., Studie a pram\u283 \'ecny k r\u233 \'e9torice a k universitn\u237 \'ed literatu\u345 \'f8e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 Praha 1972 (Pr\u225 \'e1ce z d\u283 \'ecjin University Karlovy, 9), S. 225. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch bei S. Wielgus, Die mittelalterlichen polnischen Bibelkommentare, in: Probleme der Bearbeitung mittelalterlicher Handschriften. Hg. v. H. H\u228 \'e4rtel u.a., Wiesbaden 1986 (Wolfenb\u252 \'fctteler Forschungen, 30), S. 277\endash 299 (Hs. genannt S. 282, Nr. 25). Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 98, 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (vgl. Kat. D\u252 \'fcsseldorf S. 316); Kurzfassung in Ms. B 137, 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

