\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 De celebratione missae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [Ps.-]Anselmus Cantuariensis: Oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sentencia determinativa beati Ancelmi Cantuariensis archiepiscopi super resolucione pusillanimis conscientie dubitantis an missam celebrare expedia an ne.< Dulcissime domine Ihesu Christe, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto universitatis es creator, tibi nota sunt omnia, antequam fiant, tu nosti insipienciam meam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et membrum dignum corporis tui. Per eterna secula. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: PL 158, Sp. 910\endash 913 (mit Abweichungen). Zur Verfasserfrage vgl. Glorieux, Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 62. (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quamdiu in hac lacrimarum valle exules et peregrini sumus, a patria spretis cunctis transitoriis et terrenis consolationibus pro summa delectacione et consolatione anime nostre ad mensam altaris ipsius benedicti Ihesu per dies singulos cum omni reverentia et fraterna dilectione accedamus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nunc igitur esto placates super multitudinem peccatorum nostrorum. >Finit sentencia determinativa beati Ancelmi Cantuariensis archiepiscopi super resolucionem pusillanimis consciencie dubitantis an missam celebrare expediat an non.<}

