\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Bonaventura: Tractatus de praeparatione ad missam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit tractatus de preparacione ad missam domini seraphici Johannis Bonaventura feliciter.< Ad honorem gloriose et individue trinitatis et ad honorem excellentissimi sacramenti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc autem non reputes te posse tuis viribus, sed auxilio gracie eius. Quod ipse michi et tibi prestare dignetur. Deo gracias. In dominica sexagesima viii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (27.02.1508)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . >Finit tractatus de preparacione ad missam domini seraphici Johannis Bonaventure.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Ed.: Opera omnia, Bd. 8, Quaracchi 1898, S. 99\endash 106. Distelbrink Nr. 24; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 1299; CALMA Bd. 2,4, S.\~458, Nr. 59.}

