\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Gerson: Sermo de oratione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit sermo venerabilis magistri Johannis Gerson de oracione.< Sit oracio vel obsecracio agilis et expedita, bonis associata, paciens et benigna, sit libera \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per oracionem scilicet, que vitrix et domina nature est. >Explicit sermo venerabilis magistri Johannis Gerson, cancellarii Parisiensis, de efficacia oracionis, cuius thema fuit: Obsecro vos tamquam advenas etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [I Pt 2,11]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 , factus in concilio Constanciensi.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 5, S. 398\endash 405, hier S. 401\endash 405 (stellenweise gek\u252 \'fcrzt). Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 De oratione. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oracio est pius mentis affectus ut nuncius in deum directus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 id est bona gracie et virtutibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Gerson: De oratione et suo valore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Magister Johannes Gerson de oracione.< Oportet semper orare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Lc 18,1]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Scripsit Tullius accu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tissime \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui de moribus iudicat. Deo gracias. >Explicit tractatus de valore oracionis venerabilis magistri Iohannis Gerson, cancellarii Parisiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \endash  Druck: Du Pin Bd. 3, Sp. 247\endash 262. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 De oratione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Partes oracionis quot sunt? Octo. Que? Devocio, lacrime, dulcedo, incendium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Suspicacio tamen ei accidit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

