\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Nider: Praeceptorium divinae legis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Fides cadit sub primo precepto: Qui crediderit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [Mc 16,16]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sanctus Thomas: Sufficit ad salutem cuilibet simplici credere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et vivere propter servire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Hoc Nidar in preceptorio.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Hain 11780\endash 11796. Kaeppeli Nr. 2540; Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 4832. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 6, Sp. 971\endash 977.}

