\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Gerson: De arte audiendi confessiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit tractatus de erudicione confessorum magistri Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (hannis) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Gerson.< Etsi virtus, quam assuefactio gignit, cercius quam ars operetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quam legendo erudietur atque proficient. >Et sic est finis.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 2, S. 10\endash 17. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 2030 mit Suppl.; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 14498. Schulte GQ II, S. 383.}

