\pard\fi0\li0\tx2700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Gerson: De remediis contra recidivum peccati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit tractatus magistri Iohannis Gerson de remediis contra recidivum peccandi a confessoribus dandis.< Habet hoc proprium ars quelibet, ut faciliori compendio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que omne desiderium superant sequamur. >Explicit de remediis contra recidivum.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 8, S. 67\endash 70. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 2270 mit Suppl. Schulte GQ II, S. 383. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circumstancie inquirende a confessore habuntur per hunc versum: Quis, quid, ibi, quibus auxiliis, cur, quomodo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... vgl. Walther I Nr. 16103; Walther II Nr. 25432. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item alter: Tempus, locus, metus, numerus, mora, sciencia, etas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

