\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Gerson: [Epistu\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 la ad fratrem Nicolaum] sive Forma absolutionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit forma absolucionis sacramentalis magistri Iohannis Gerson.< Gracia tibi et pax, frater karissime. Petis primo, si apud aliquem doctorem reperiatur forma auctentica absolucionis sacramentalis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in Summa confessorum iii libro, capitulo 34, quaestione xci habetur. >Explicit forma absolucionis sacramentalis Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (hannis) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Gerson.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 2, S. 133\endash 136. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 2249. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 74, Teil I, 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

