\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Gerson\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 : [Quaestiones Quattuor circa pa\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 enitentiam et de detractione]. Quaestio de custodia linguae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit notabilis questio de custodia lingue et examinacione consciencie venerabilis magistri Johannis Gerson, sacre theologie doctoris preclarissimi et cancellarii Parisiensis.< Queritur an male loqui de aliis in eorum absencia sit semper peccatum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nulli in contemptu. >Explicit questio de custodia lingue.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 9, S. 64\endash 70. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 4499. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 70, 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 und Ms. B 75, 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 25890, Hs. genannt). K\u252 \'fcrzere Fassung in Ms. B 108, 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

