\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Gerson: De probatione spirituum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit tractatus de probacione spirituum. Gerson.< Probate spiritus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... [I Io 4,1], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 iubet discipulus ille \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et practicare omnia, que data \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sunt. >Explicit tractatulus de probacione spirituum venerabilis magistri Johannis Gerson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \endash  Druck: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 9, S. 177\endash 185. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 4280.}

