\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Gerson: De modo vivendi omnium fidelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit tractatus bonus eiusdem de modo vivendi omnium fidelium. Ad nobiles prima regula.< Regula prima, que spectat ad nobiles, potentes et scabinos, ne pauperes videlicet per potenciam suam opprimant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pax super illos et misericordia. Amen. >Gerson de modo vivendi.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 8, S. 1\endash 5. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 5127. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 74, 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

