\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Gerson: De modo vivendi omnium fidelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit tractatus bonus magistri Johannis Gerson de modo vivendi omnium fidelium. Ad nobiles prima regula.< Regula prima, que spectat ad nobiles, potentes et scabinos, ne pauperes videlicet per potenciam suam opprimant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pax super illos et misericordia. Amen. >Expliciunt regule pulchre.< \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: Glorieux, Gerson, Bd. 8, S. 1\endash 5. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 5127. Text \u252 \'fcberliefert auch in Ms. B 74, 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und Ms. B 204, 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

