\pard\fi0\li0\tx705\tx1410\tx2130\tx2835\tx3540\tx4245\tx4950\tx5670\tx6375\tx7080\tx7785\tx8490\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 [Isidorus Hispalensis: Synonyma]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In summo honore summa sit tibi humilitas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ubi locuple\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >|| \endash  Ed.: CC 111 B, hier S. 134\endash 138 (Text gek\u252 \'fcrzt). Zum Text vgl. Ms. B 153, 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

