\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Bernardus Claraevallensis: Sermones aestivales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Bestand nach Leclerq/Rochais Bd. 5 und 6,1 (Predigtanl\u228 \'e4sse in der vorliegenden Hs. stellenweise abweichend): (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In resurrectione domini: (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Die lewe van Iudas geslecht heuet verwonnen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Apc 5,5]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Claerlicken dye wysheit heuet die boesheit verwonnen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 daer hij ons hem seluen wyl toenen, die leuet bauen al ende gebenediet in ewicheit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Leclerq/Rochais Bd. 5, S. 73\endash 94. (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 2. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Dat ander sermoen in die p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (aessche).< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Wy hebben ontfangen van den heiligen apostel, dat Christus in onsen harten woent \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Comt ende siet, waer die here was gelacht \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [Mt 28,6]. Ebd., S. 95\endash 102. (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 3. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Dat derde sermoen de resurreccione.< Ghelyckerwys alsmen in der medicinen des lychams yrste plech toe geuen purgacie ende daer nae spijse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Doe wart die gotlicke wijsheit claerlicken geapenbaert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Ebd., S. 103\endash 109. (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 4. Ebd., S. 110 f. (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In octava paschae: (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. Ebd., S. 112\endash 117. (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 2. Ebd., S. 118\endash 121. (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In rogationibus. Ebd., S. 121\endash 123. (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In ascensione domini: (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. Ebd., S. 123\endash 126. (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 2. Ebd., S. 126\endash 131. (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 3. Ebd., S. 131\endash 137. (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 4. Ebd., S. 137\endash 148. (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 6. Ebd., S. 150\endash 160. (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 5. Ebd., S. 149 f. (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In die pentecostes: (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. Ebd., S. 160\endash 165. (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 2. Ebd., S. 165\endash 170. (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 3. Ebd., S. 171\endash 176. (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In nativitate sancti Iohannis Baptistae. Ebd., S. 176\endash 184. (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Nicolaus Claraevallensis]: Sermo in nativitate sancti Iohannis Baptistae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Druck der lat. Fassung: PL 144, Sp. 627\endash 637 (Ps.-Petrus Damiani); PL 184, Sp. 991\endash 1002. Zur Verfasserfrage vgl. Glorieux, Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 60; Schneyer Bd. 4, S. 250, Nr. 1. (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In vigilia apostolorum Petri et Pauli. Leclerq/Rochais, Bd. 5, S. 185\endash 187. (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In sollemnitate apostolorum Petri et Pauli: (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. Ebd., S. 188\endash 191. (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 3. Ebd., S. 197\endash 201. (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In assumptione beatae Mariae, Sermo 6. Ebd., S. 260 f. (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermones de diversis, Sermo 47 De annunciatione Dominica. Ebd., Bd. 6,1, S. 266. (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dominica infra octavam assumptionis. Ebd., Bd. 5, S. 262\endash 274. (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dominica IV. post pentecosten. Ebd., S. 202\endash 205. (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dominica VI post pentecosten, Sermo 1. Ebd., S. 206\endash 209. (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermones de diversis, Sermo de misericordiis. Ebd., Bd. 6,1, S. 40\endash 43. (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dominica VI. post pentecosten, Sermo 2. Ebd., Bd. 5, S. 209. (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In labore messis: (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. Ebd., S. 217\endash 219. (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 2. Ebd., S. 220\endash 222. (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo de altitudine et bassitudine cordis. Ebd., S. 214\endash 216. (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In labore messis, Sermo 3. Ebd., S. 222\endash 228. (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Nicolaus Claraevallensis]: Sermo in festo beatae Mariae Magdalenae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Druck der lat. Fassung: PL 144, Sp. 660\endash 666 (Ps.-Petrus Damiani); PL 185 (1), Sp. 213\endash 220. Zur Verfasserfrage vgl. Glorieux, Pour revaloriser Migne, S. 60; Schneyer Bd. 4, S. 250, Nr. 4. (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In assumptione beatae Mariae: (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. Ebd., S. 228\endash 231; (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 2. Ebd., S. 231\endash 238; (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 3. Ebd., S. 238\endash 244; (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 4. Ebd., S. 244\endash 250; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 5. Ebd., S. 250\endash 260. (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In nativitate Mariae. Ebd., S. 275\endash 288. (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo ad abbates. Ebd., S. 288\endash 293. (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In commemorationem sancti Michaelis: (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. Ebd., S. 294\endash 298; (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 2. Ebd., S. 299\endash 303. (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In festivitate Omnium sanctorum: (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. Ebd., S. 327\endash 341; (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 5. Ebd., Bd. 5, S. 361\endash 370. (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In transitu sancti Malachiae episcopi. Ebd., S. 417\endash 423. (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In festivitate sancti Martini. Ebd., S. 399\endash 412. (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In natali sancti Clementis. Ebd., S. 412\endash 417. (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In dedicatione ecclesiae: (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 1. Ebd., S. 370\endash 375. (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 2. Ebd., S. 375\endash 378. (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 3. Ebd., S. 379\endash 382. (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 4. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dat vierde sermoen van der s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (eluer) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (echtijt).< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mit begeerlicken laue vieren wy die hoechtit van huden ende wy eren si mit hoeger blitscop. Mer wanttet geestelicken menschen nyet en betemt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 als wy alden dach in den heren gelaft sullen werden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Ebd., S. 383\endash 388. (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sermo 5. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dat vyfte sermoen van der seluer hoechtijt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oeck huden begaen wy een hoechtijt, die seer groet is. Dyt mach ic wael lichtelicken seggen, mer als men vort wyl vragen, van wat heylich dese hoechtit is \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 mytter hulpen des goens, die in der ewicheit is gebenedijt. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Ebd., S. 388\endash 396. (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In obitu domni Humberti. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Een sermoen sunte B\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (ernardi) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 van dem dode des heiligen vaders Humberti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Humbertus, die knecht gads, is gestoruen, een deuoet knecht ende een ghetrouwe knecht \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 op dat ghy tot deyn moeget comen, daer Humbertus toe is gecomen. Die in der ewicheit is gebenediet. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Ebd., S. 440\endash 447. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Expliciunt sermones estivales beati Bernardi Abbatis Clarevallensis finiti et completi dei adiutorio anno domini nostri Ihesu Christi M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 CCCClxxviii, tercio kal. aprilis, hora pene sexta post cenam, per me, Hilkman Kiesendael de Orsoy. Libri scriptorem celi, deus, effice civem Bernardi meritis, cuius nos dogmate pascis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< Nachtrag von anderer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item post sermonem Malachie legatur sermonem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Humberti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Insgesamt 53 Sermones. Alle Initien im Register. H. Willemsen, Die Handschriften, s.o., S. 29\endash 31; C. Lingier, Over de verspreiding van Sint-Bernardus\rquote  liturgische sermoenen in het middelnederlands, in: Ons geestelijk erf 64, 1990, S. 18\endash 40 (Hs. genannt S. 21, Anm. 7); Ermens/van Dijk, Repertorium, S. 198\endash 201; Mazurek, Handschriften, S. 96. Zur volkssprachigen \u220 \'dcberlieferung der Predigten vgl. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 1, Sp. 756 und ebd. Bd. 11, Sp. 242 (Hs. genannt; irrt\u252 \'fcmlich: Ms. B 209). Zur lat. Fassung vgl. CALMA Bd. 2,3, S. 307, Nr. 12.}

