\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs26 Speculum humanae salvationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Alphabetisches Register. (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prooemium: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit prohemium nove copulacionis, cuius et tytulus est Speculum humane salvacionis. Expediens dicitur et utile \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Notabilia: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Qui ad iusticiam erudiunt multos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit speculum humane salvacionis, in quo patet casus hominis et modus reparacionis. In hoc speculo potest homo considerare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ubi sine fine merear gaudio sempiterno perfrui. Quod nobis omnibus prestare dignetur dominus Ihesus Christus, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto est in perpetuum benedictus. Amen. Deo laus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Ed.: J. Lutz / P. Perdrizet, Speculum humanae salvationis, Mulhouse, Leipzig 1907, Bd. 1, S. 2\endash 99. Bloomfield/Guyot Nr. 2562 mit Suppl. und Nr. 4579; Hamesse/Szyller Nr. 18142; Stegm\u252 \'fcller RB Nr. 11765; Walther I Nr. 9199, 9201 und 15390. VL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bd. 9, Sp. 52\endash 65 und Bd. 11, Sp. 1442. Unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig in Ms. B 78, 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}
